Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once upon a time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,in a kingdom far，far away，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.19,0:01:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,the king and queen were blessed with a beautiful baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,And throughout the land，everyone was happy…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.39,0:01:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,until the sun went down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,and they saw that their daughter was cursed with a frightful enchantment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,that took hold each and every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Desperate，they sought the help of a fairy godmother
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,who had them lock the young princess away in a tower，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,there to await the kiss…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,of the handsome Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was he who would chance the perilous journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,through blistering cold and scorching desert
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,traveling for many days and nights，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,risking life and limb
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.19,0:01:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,to reach the Dragon 's keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,For he was the bravest，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,and most handsome…in all the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it was destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.69,0:02:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,his kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,would break the dreaded curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,He alone would
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,climb to the highest room of the tallest tower to enter the princess's chambers，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,cross the room to her sleeping silhouette，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,pull back the gossamer curtains to find her…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Princess… Fiona？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，thank heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is she？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's on her honeymoon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honeymoon？With whom？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.59,0:02:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ So she said what's the problem，baby？∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ What's the problem？I don't know ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Well maybe I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ How much longer will it take to cure this？∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Just to cure it，'cause I can't ignore it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ if it's love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Makes me wanna turn around and face me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But I don't know nothing 'bout love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Oh，come on，come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Turn a little faster ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Come on，come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ The world will follow after ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Come on，come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Everybody's after love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ So I said I'm a snowball running ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Running down into this spring that's coming all this love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Melting under blue skies ，Belting out sunlight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Shimmering love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Well，baby，I surrender ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ To the strawberry ice cream ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Never ever end of all this love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Well，I didn't mean to do it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But there's no escaping your love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:04:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ These lines of lightning mean we're never alone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Never alone，no，no ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Come on，come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Jump a little higher ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Come on，come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ If you feel a little lighter ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Come on，come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ We were once upon a time in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ We 're accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in love，I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in love，I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:04:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's so good to be home！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.22,0:05:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just you and me and…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.81,0:05:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Two can be as bad as one… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek！Fiona！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aren't you two a sight for sore eyes！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us a hug，Shrek，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,you old love machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And look at you，Mrs。Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,How 'bout a side of sugar for the steed？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.61,0:05:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey，what are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.81,0:05:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Taking care of your love nest for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you mean like… sorting the mail
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,and watering the plants？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，and feeding the fish！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have any fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I call that one Shrek and the other Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,That Shrek is a rascally devil。Get your…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at the time。I guess you'd better be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you want to tell me about your trip？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or how about a game of Parcheesi？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，Donkey？Shouldn't you be getting home to Dragon？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah，that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。She's been all moody and stuff lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought I'd move in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know we're always happy to see you，Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Fiona and I are married now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need a little time，you know，to be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say no more。Say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will always be here to make sure nobody bothers you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.51,0:06:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，roomie？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，OK。All right，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,cool。I guess… Me and Pinocchio was going to catch a tournament，anyway，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll see y'all Sunday for a barbecue or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll be fine。Now，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,where were we？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，I know！Alone！I'm going！I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want me to tell these other guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enough，Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Dearest Princess Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,「You are hereby summoned to the Kingdom of Far，Far Away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,「for a royal ball in celebration of your marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「at which time the King will bestow his royal blessing…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「 upon you and your…uh… Prince Charming.」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Love，the King and Queen of Far，Far Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「aka Mom and Dad.」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prince Charming？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.41,0:07:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Royal ball？Can I come？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,don't you think they might be a bit… shocked
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,to see you like this？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，they might be a bit surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:07:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they're my parents，Shrek。They love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't worry。They'll love you，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it。They're not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you explain Sergeant Pompous
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the Fancy Pants Club Band？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on！You could at least give them a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,To do what？Sharpen their pitchforks？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！They just want to give you their blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great。Now I need their blessing？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you want to be a part of this family，yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who says I want to be part of this family？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You did！When you married me！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there's some fine print for you！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,So that's it。You won't come？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me。It's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are not going！And that's final！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.51,0:08:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！We don't want to hit traffic！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry！We'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，wait for me。Oof！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hit it！Move 'em on！Head 'em up！Head 'em up，move 'em on！Head 'em up！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rawhide！Move 'em on！Head 'em up！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move 'em on！Move 'em on！Head 'em up！Rawhide！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we there yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we there yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，are we there yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we there yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we there yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.03,0:09:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we there yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we there yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are not！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are we there yet？- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we there yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:09:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's really immature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is why nobody likes you。- This is why nobody likes ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your loss！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna just stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finally！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is taking forever，Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no in-flight movie or nothing！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Far，Far Away，Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's where we're going。Far，far…away！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，all right，I get it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just so darn bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，find a way to entertain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,For five minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.53,0:10:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you not be yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,for five minutes！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we there yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，finally！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's going to be champagne wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,and caviar dreams from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.53,0:11:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，good-looking！We'll be back to pick you up later！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too late to regret this time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Well I talk about it… talk about it… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，everyone，look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Talk about it talk about movin… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，ladies！Nice day for a parade，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You working that hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Swimming pools！Movie stars！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Announcing the long-awaited return of the beautiful Princess Fiona
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,and her new husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… why don't you guys go ahead？I'll park the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,you still think this was a good idea？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。Mom and Dad look happy to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who on earth are they？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think that's our little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:14:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not little！That's a really big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wasn't she supposed to kiss Prince Charming and break the spell？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he's no Prince Charming，but they do look…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Happy now？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,We came。We saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now let's go before they light the torches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？They locked you in a tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was for my own…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good！Here's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go back inside and pretend we're not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harold，we have to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick！While they're not looking we can make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek，stop it！Everything's gonna be…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,A disaster！There is no way…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really… Really…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,want…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,to… be…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet my husband…Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's easy to see where Fiona gets her good looks from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better out than in，I always say，eh，Fiona？That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean，「not on the list」？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you don't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's happening，everybody？Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had the hardest time finding this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！Bad donkey！Bad！Down！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:16:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Dad！It's all right。It's all right。He's with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,He helped rescue me from the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's me：the noble steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Waiter！How 'bout a bowl for the steed？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.05,0:16:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？Oh，sorry！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great soup，Mrs Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.75,0:16:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no。Darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，Fiona，tell us about where you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well…Shrek owns his own land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you，honey？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's in an enchanted forest
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,abundant in squirrels and cute little duckies and…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you ain't talking about the swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,An ogre from a swamp。Oh！How original.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suppose that would be a fine place to raise the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a bit early to be thinking about that，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- lndeed。I just started eating。- Harold！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's great，OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,For his type，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,My type？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dinner is served！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never mind。I can hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bon appetit！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Mexican food！My favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's not sit here with our tummies rumbling。Everybody dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do，Lillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suppose any grandchildren I could expect from you would be…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ogres，yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not that there's anything wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，Harold？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！No！Of course，not！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is，assuming you don't eat your own young！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.56,0:17:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，we usually prefer the ones who've been locked away in a tower！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek，please！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only did that because I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:18:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，day care or dragon-guarded castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand。You're not her father！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's so nice to have the family together for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Harold！- Shrek！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fiona！- Fiona！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mom！- Harold…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.57,0:19:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Yourfallen tears have called to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ So，here comes my sweet remedy ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I know what every princess needs ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ For her to live life happily… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，sweet pea！I'm your fairy godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a fairy godmother？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shush，shush.Now，don't worry。I'm here to make it all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,With just a…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Wave of my magic wand Your troubles will soon be gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ With a flick of the wrist and just a flash You'll land a prince with a ton of cash ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ A high-priced dress made by mice no less ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Some crystal glass pumps And no more stress ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Your worries will vanish，your soul will cleanse ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Confide in your very own furniture friends ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ We 'll help you set a new fashion trend ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I'll make you fancy ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I'll make you great ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ The kind of girl a prince would date ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ They'll write your name on the bathroom wall… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ For a happy ever after，give Fiona a call ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ A sporty carriage to ride in style，Sexy man boy chauffeur，Kyle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Banish your blemishes，tooth decay，Cellulite thighs will fade away ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And oh，what the hey！Have a bichon frise！∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.17,0:20:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Nip and tuck，here and there to land that prince with the perfect hair ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Lipstick liners，shadows blush To get that prince with the sexy tush ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.97,0:20:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Lucky day，hunk buffet You and your prince take a roll in the hay ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:21:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ You can spoon on the moon With the prince to the tune ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Don't be drab，you'll be fab Your prince will have rock-hard abs ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Cheese souffle，Valentine's Day Have some chicken fricassee ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Nip and tuck，here and there To land that prince with the perfect hair ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.78,0:21:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you very much，Fairy Godmother，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I really don't need all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine。Be that way。We didn't like you，anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.27,0:21:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！You got a puppy？All I got in my room was shampoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fairy Godmother，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,furniture…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet my husband，Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your husband？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.07,0:21:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？What did you say？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,When did this happen？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek is the one who rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,But that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great，more relatives！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good！She can help us pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your coat，dear。We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:21:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？I don't want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:21:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,When did you decide this？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shortly after arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I'm sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，that's all right。I need to go，anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,But remember，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you should ever need me…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.37,0:22:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,happiness… is just a teardrop away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.69,0:22:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，but we've got all the happiness we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.47,0:22:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Happy，happy，happy…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.07,0:22:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Very nice，Shrek。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you coming here was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You could've at least tried to get along with my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I was going to get Daddy's blessing，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,even if I did want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think it might be nice if somebody asked me what I wanted？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。Do you want me to pack for you？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.08,0:22:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're unbelievable！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're behaving like a…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on！Say it！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like an ogre！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.09,0:22:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's a news flash for you！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whether your parents like it or not… I am an ogre！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.48,0:23:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,And guess what，Princess？That's not about to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.19,0:23:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've made changes for you，Shrek。Think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's real smooth，Shrek。「I'm an ogre！」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.69,0:23:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should。You started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe that，Lillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.59,0:23:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the ogre。Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.79,0:23:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think，Harold，you're taking this a little too personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.19,0:24:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Fiona's choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.39,0:24:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,But she was supposed to choose the prince we picked for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，you expect me to give my blessings to this… thing？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.09,0:24:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,And she'll never forgive you if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.49,0:24:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose our daughter again，Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you act as if love is totally predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.68,0:24:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you remember when we were young？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.18,0:24:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,We used to walk down by the lily pond and…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.49,0:24:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,they were in bloom…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not the same！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.19,0:24:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think you realize that our daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.69,0:24:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,has married a monster！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.50,0:24:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，stop being such a drama king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.59,0:24:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine！Pretend there's nothing wrong！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't it all wonderful！I'd like to know how it could get any worse！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.09,0:24:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.00,0:24:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.08,0:24:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing，dear！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.59,0:24:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just the old crusade wound playing up a bit！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.38,0:24:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll just stretch it out here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.29,0:24:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.19,0:24:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，Fairy Godmother，off to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.69,0:25:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Already taken my pills，and they tend to make me a bit drowsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.50,0:25:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，how about… we make this a quick visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.48,0:25:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.69,0:25:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hello。Ha-ha-ha！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.89,0:25:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what's new？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.28,0:25:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You remember my son，Prince Charming？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.69,0:25:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that you？My gosh！It's been years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,When did you get back？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.00,0:25:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，about five minutes ago，actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.99,0:25:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,After I endured blistering winds，scorching desert…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.80,0:25:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I climbed to the highest room in the tallest tower…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.09,0:25:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mommy can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He endures blistering winds and scorching desert！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.10,0:25:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,He climbs to the highest bloody room of the tallest bloody tower…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.09,0:25:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But… - And what does he find？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.48,0:25:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some gender-confused wolf
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.69,0:25:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,telling him that his princess
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.49,0:25:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,is already married.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.09,0:25:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It wasn't my fault。He didn't get there in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.20,0:25:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop the car！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You force me to do something I really don't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.49,0:26:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are we？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。Welcome to Friar's Fat Boy！May I take your order？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,My diet is ruined！I hope you're happy。Er… okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two Renaissance Wraps，no mayo… chili rings…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.19,0:26:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll have the Medieval Meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,One Medieval Meal and，Harold…Curly fries？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.70,0:26:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sourdough soft taco，then？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.71,0:26:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，really，I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.69,0:26:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your order，Fairy Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.90,0:26:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,This comes with the Medieval Meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.30,0:26:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you are，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We made a deal，Harold，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.60,0:26:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I assume you don't want me to go back on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.29,0:26:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Indeed not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.89,0:26:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，Fiona and Charming will be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.80,0:26:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Believe me，Harold。It's what's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.60,0:26:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not only for your daughter…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.50,0:26:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,but for your Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.19,0:27:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do about it？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.51,0:27:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on in，Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.00,0:27:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I like my town ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.51,0:27:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ With a little drop of poison ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.30,0:28:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Nobody knows… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.01,0:28:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.01,0:28:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do I know you？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.51,0:28:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you must be mistaking me for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.40,0:28:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… excuse me。I'm looking for the Ugly Stepsister.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.70,0:28:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah！There you are。Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.60,0:28:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，I need to have someone taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.01,0:28:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's the guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.91,0:28:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he's not a guy，per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.21,0:28:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… He's an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.30,0:28:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，buddy，let me clue you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.51,0:28:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's only one fellow who can handle a job like that，and，frankly…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.50,0:28:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,he don't like to be disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.62,0:28:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where could I find him？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.31,0:28:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.21,0:28:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who dares enter my room？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.11,0:28:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry！I hope I'm not interrupting，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.21,0:28:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I'm told you're the one to talk to about an ogre problem？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:28:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are told correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.00,0:29:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,But for this，I charge a great deal of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.31,0:29:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would… this be enough？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.90,0:29:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have engaged my valuable services，Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.61,0:29:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just tell me where I can find this ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.21,0:29:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Everyone says I'm getting down too low ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.72,0:29:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Everyone says you've just gotta let it go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.82,0:29:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ You just gotta let it go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.91,0:30:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I need some sleep ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.51,0:30:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Time to put the old horse down ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.31,0:30:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in too deep ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.92,0:30:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And the wheels keep spinning round ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.32,0:30:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Everyone says you've just gotta let it go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.02,0:30:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dear Knight，I pray that you take this favor as a token of my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.01,0:30:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dear Diary…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.52,0:31:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sleeping Beauty is having a slumber party tomorrow，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.32,0:31:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,but Dad says I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.91,0:31:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,He never lets me out after sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.71,0:31:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad says I'm going away for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must be like some finishing school.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.81,0:31:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom says that when I'm old enough，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.01,0:31:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,my Prince Charming will rescue me from my tower
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.62,0:31:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,and bring me back to my family，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.52,0:31:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we'll all live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.82,0:31:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs。Fiona Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs。Fiona Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs。Fiona Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.22,0:31:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs。Fiona Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.91,0:31:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。I hope I'm not interrupting anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no。I was just reading a，uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.22,0:31:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,A scary book.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd let me apologize for my despicable behavior earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.72,0:31:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:31:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what came over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.62,0:32:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you suppose we could pretend it never happened and start over…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.51,0:32:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Your Majesty，I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.72,0:32:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。Call me Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.83,0:32:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,We both acted like ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.73,0:32:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe we just need some time to get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excellent idea！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.03,0:32:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was actually hoping you might join me for a morning hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.53,0:32:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,A little father-son time？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.32,0:32:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it would mean the world to Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.72,0:32:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shall we say，7：30 by the old oak？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.43,0:32:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Face it，Donkey！We're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.42,0:32:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't be lost。We followed the King's instructions exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Head to the darkest part of the woods…」
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Past the sinister trees with scary-looking branches.」
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.52,0:32:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bush shaped like Shirley Bassey！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.53,0:32:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We passed that three times already！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.13,0:33:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were the one who said not to stop for directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.13,0:33:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.13,0:33:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,My one chance to fix things up with Fiona's dad
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.33,0:33:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I end up lost in the woods with you！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.63,0:33:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't get huffy！I'm only trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.33,0:33:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know！I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.72,0:33:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.82,0:33:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just really need to make things work with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.02,0:33:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，sure。Now let's go bond with Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.03,0:33:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，well，well，Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.13,0:33:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it was kind of a tender moment back there，but the purring？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.23,0:33:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？I ain't purring.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.13,0:33:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。What's next？A hug？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.53,0:33:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Shrek。Donkeys don't purr。What do you think I am，some kind of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.92,0:33:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha-ha！Fear me，if you dare！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.13,0:33:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！A little cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.23,0:33:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out，Shrek！He got a piece！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.73,0:33:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a cat，Donkey。Come here，little kitty，kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.13,0:34:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，little kitty。Come here。Oh！Come here，little kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.42,0:34:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on，Shrek！I'm coming！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.03,0:34:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.23,0:34:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it off！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.13,0:34:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it off！Oh，God。Oh…No
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.13,0:34:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out，Shrek！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.52,0:34:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it off！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold still！Shrek！Hold still！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.04,0:34:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did I miss？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.13,0:34:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.54,0:34:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.43,0:34:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，ye ogre，pray for mercy from…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.23,0:34:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Puss…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.92,0:34:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,in Boots！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.52,0:34:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll kill that cat！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.63,0:34:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hairball.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.03,0:35:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！That is nasty！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.43,0:35:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,What should we do with him？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.13,0:35:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the sword and neuter him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.43,0:35:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give him the Bob Barker treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.94,0:35:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！Por favor！Please！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.03,0:35:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I implore you！It was nothing personal，Senor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.63,0:35:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was doing it only for my family.My mother，she is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.24,0:35:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,And my father lives off the garbage！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.44,0:35:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,The King offered me much in gold and I have a litter of brothers…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.93,0:35:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona's father paid you to do this？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.43,0:35:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rich King？Si.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.85,0:35:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，so much for Dad's royal blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.25,0:35:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.23,0:35:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost everybody that meets you wants to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.04,0:35:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gee，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.44,0:35:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe Fiona would've been better off
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.34,0:35:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,if I were some sort of Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.44,0:35:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what the King said.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.04,0:35:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，uh… sorry。I thought that question was directed at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.64,0:35:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek，Fiona knows you'd do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.53,0:36:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's not like I wouldn't change if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.13,0:36:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just… I just wish I could make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.73,0:36:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold the phone…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.34,0:36:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Happiness」.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.33,0:36:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「A tear drop away」.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.64,0:36:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey！Think of the saddest thing that's ever happened to you！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.24,0:36:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aw，man，where do I begin？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.34,0:36:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,First there was the time that old farmer tried to sell me for some magic beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.84,0:36:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then this fool had a party
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.84,0:36:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he have the guests trying to pin the tail on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.55,0:36:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then they got drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.54,0:36:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,and start beating me with a stick，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.84,0:36:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,going 「Pinata！！」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.75,0:36:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is a pinata，anyway？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.45,0:36:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Donkey！I need you to cry！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.94,0:36:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't go projecting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.85,0:36:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you're feeling bad，but you got to…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.53,0:36:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You little，hairy，litter-licking sack of…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.15,0:36:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Is it on？Is it on？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.74,0:36:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Fairy Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.54,0:37:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm either away from my desk or with a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.03,0:37:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if you come by the office，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.14,0:37:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,we'll be glad to make you an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.74,0:37:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have a 「happy ever after。」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.54,0:37:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you up for a little quest，Donkey？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.75,0:37:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's more like it！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.05,0:37:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek and Donkey，on another whirlwind adventure！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.55,0:37:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Ain't no stoppin' us now！Whoo！We're on the move！∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.95,0:37:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop，Ogre！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.04,0:37:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have misjudged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.04,0:37:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Join the club。We've got jackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.84,0:37:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,On my honor，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.05,0:37:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am obliged to accompany you until I have saved your life
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.84,0:37:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,as you have spared me mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.73,0:37:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,The position of annoying talking animal has already been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.24,0:37:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.14,0:37:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.75,0:37:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shrek！- Aw，come on，Donkey。Look at him…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.25,0:37:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,in his wee little boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，how many cats can wear boots？Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.35,0:37:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's keep him！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.15,0:37:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say what？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.96,0:38:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen。He's purring！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.66,0:38:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，so now it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.94,0:38:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Donkey。Lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.95,0:38:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lighten up？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.55,0:38:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lighten up？I should lighten up？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.55,0:38:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look who's telling who to lighten up！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.85,0:38:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.05,0:38:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.04,0:38:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're both festive，aren't they？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.04,0:38:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think，Harold？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.06,0:38:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… Yes，yes。Fine。Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.55,0:38:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try to at least pretend you're interested in your daughter's wedding ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.55,0:38:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly，Lillian，I don't think it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.05,0:38:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do we know there will even be a ball？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.45,0:38:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom。Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.15,0:38:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hello，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.55,0:38:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that，Cedric？Right！Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.25,0:38:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom，have you seen Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.65,0:39:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't。You should ask your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.66,0:39:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be sure and use small words，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.55,0:39:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a little slow this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.15,0:39:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I help you，Your Majesty？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.95,0:39:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mmm！Exquisite。What do you call this dish？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.55,0:39:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would be the dog's breakfast，Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.84,0:39:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，yes。Very good，then。Carry on，Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.65,0:39:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？Dad，have you seen Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.25,0:39:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I haven't，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.64,0:39:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure he just went off to look for a nice…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.05,0:39:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,mud hole to cool down in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.65,0:39:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，after your little spat last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.06,0:39:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。You heard that，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.85,0:39:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The whole kingdom heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.15,0:39:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，after all，it is in his nature to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.56,0:39:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,well，a bit of a brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.74,0:39:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Him？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.55,0:39:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，you didn't exactly roll out the Welcome Wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.55,0:39:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what did you expect？Look at what he's done to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.06,0:39:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek loves me for who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.06,0:39:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would think you'd be happy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.56,0:39:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darling，I'm just thinking about what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.26,0:39:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you should do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.25,0:40:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，really？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.96,0:40:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no。That's the old Keebler's place。Let's back away slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.36,0:40:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the Fairy Godmother's cottage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.95,0:40:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's the largest producer of hexes and potions in the whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.56,0:40:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then why don't we pop in there for a spell？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.06,0:40:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha-ha！Spell！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.56,0:40:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,He makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.35,0:40:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。I'm here to see the…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.05,0:40:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Fairy Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.26,0:40:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。She is not in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.45,0:40:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jerome！Coffee and a Monte Cristo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.06,0:41:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.15,0:41:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Fairy Godmother。Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.54,0:41:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，she's not seeing any clients today，OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.35,0:41:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's OK，buddy。We're from the union.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.57,0:41:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,The union？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.87,0:41:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,We represent the workers
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.07,0:41:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,in all magical industries，both evil and benign.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.47,0:41:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Oh，right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.97,0:41:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you feeling at all degraded or oppressed？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.15,0:41:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.36,0:41:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't even have dental.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.15,0:41:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,They don't even have dental.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.06,0:41:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，we'll just have a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.36,0:41:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.57,0:41:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it'd be better if the Fairy Godmother didn't know we were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.66,0:41:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Know what I'm saying？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.56,0:41:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop it。- Of course。Go right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.66,0:42:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,A drop of desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.67,0:42:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Naughty！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.86,0:42:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,A pinch of passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.56,0:42:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,And just a hint of…Iust！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.96,0:42:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.37,0:42:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry to barge in like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.87,0:42:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What in Grimm's name are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.66,0:42:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it seems that Fiona's not exactly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.36,0:42:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And there's some question as to why that is？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.95,0:42:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，let's explore that，shall we？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.36,0:42:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.67,0:42:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,P，P，P… Princess。Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.96,0:42:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we are。「Lived happily ever after.」 Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.07,0:42:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No ogres！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.07,0:43:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's see。Snow White.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.87,0:43:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,A handsome prince。Oh，no ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.67,0:43:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sleeping Beauty。Oh，no ogres！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.97,0:43:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hansel and Gretel？No！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.97,0:43:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thumbelina？No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.38,0:43:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Golden Bird，the Little Mermaid，Pretty Woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.88,0:43:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，no，no！You see，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.37,0:43:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,ogres don't live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.17,0:43:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，look，lady！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.17,0:43:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you point… those dirty green sausages at me！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.66,0:43:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your Monte Cristo and coffee。Oh！Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.17,0:43:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah… that's okay.We were just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.26,0:43:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very sorry to have wasted your time，Miss Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.86,0:43:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just… go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.17,0:43:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.97,0:43:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,TGlF，eh，buddy？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.87,0:44:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Working hard or hardly working，eh，Mac？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.77,0:44:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your fine Corinthian footwear
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.57,0:44:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,and your cat cheeks out of my face！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.57,0:44:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，that stinks！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.87,0:44:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't exactly smell like a basket of roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.36,0:44:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，one of these has got to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.97,0:44:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just concocting this very plan！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.37,0:44:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Already our minds are becoming one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.17,0:44:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.38,0:44:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we need an expert on licking ourselves，we'll give you a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.27,0:44:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek，this is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.27,0:44:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。Make yourself useful and go keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.57,0:44:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Puss，do you think you could get to those on top？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.67,0:44:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,No problema，boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.77,0:44:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,In one of my nine lives，I was the great cat
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.37,0:44:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,burglar of Santiago de Compostela.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.58,0:44:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek，are you off your nut？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.87,0:44:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey，keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.07,0:44:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep watch？Yeah，I'll keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.49,0:45:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll watch that wicked witch come
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.47,0:45:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,and whammy a world of hurt up your backside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.58,0:45:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll laugh，too。I'll be giggling to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.58,0:45:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you see？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.57,0:45:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toad Stool Softener？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure a nice
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,BM is the perfect solution for marital problems
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.77,0:45:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Elfa Seltzer？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.58,0:45:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hex Lax？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.77,0:45:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Try 「handsome.」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.37,0:45:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。No handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.97,0:45:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！How about 「Happily Ever After」？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.48,0:45:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what does it do？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.88,0:45:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It says 「Beauty Divine.」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.58,0:45:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,In some cultures，donkeys are revered as the wisest of creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.98,0:45:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Especially us talking ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.68,0:45:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.08,0:45:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,That'll have to do。We've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.89,0:45:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we get on with this？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.88,0:45:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.87,0:46:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice catch，Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.17,0:46:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finally！A good use for your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.78,0:46:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.48,0:46:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ You spurn my natural emotions ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.28,0:46:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ You make me feel like dirt and I'm hurt ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.48,0:46:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And if I start a commotion ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.98,0:46:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I run the risk of losing you and that's worse ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.28,0:46:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Ever fallen in love with someone，ever fallen in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.09,0:46:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ In love with someone，ever fallen in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.69,0:46:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ In love with someone you shouldn 't have fallen in love with ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.48,0:46:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Ever fallen in love with someone，ever fallen in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.08,0:47:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ In love with someone，ever fallen in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.88,0:47:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ With someone you shouldn 't have fallen in love with ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.88,0:47:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Fallen in love with ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.98,0:47:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Ever fallen in love with someone you shouldn 't have fallen in love with ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.99,0:47:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care whose fault it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.58,0:47:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just get this place cleaned up！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.58,0:47:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fairy Godmother
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.79,0:47:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,And somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.38,0:47:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,bring me something deep fried and smothered in chocolate！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.39,0:47:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mother！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.29,0:47:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charming。Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.79,0:47:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,This isn't a good time，pumpkin。Mama's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.39,0:47:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，what happened here？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.99,0:47:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ogre，that's what！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.79,0:47:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.79,0:47:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he，Mom？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.98,0:47:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shall rend his head from his shoulders！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.68,0:47:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will smite him where he stands！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.89,0:47:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,He will rue the very day he stole my kingdom from me！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.79,0:47:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，put it away，Junior！You're still going to be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.38,0:47:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll just have to come up with something smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.49,0:47:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pardon。Um…Everything is accounted for，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.58,0:47:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fairy Godmother，except for one potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.39,0:48:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.59,0:48:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do believe we can make this work to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.79,0:48:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Happily Ever After Potion。Maximum strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.48,0:48:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「For you and your true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.39,0:48:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「If one of you drinks this，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.60,0:48:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,you both will be fine。「Happiness，comfort and beauty divine.」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.39,0:48:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You both will be fine？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.70,0:48:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess it means it'll affect Fiona，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.39,0:48:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man，this don't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.19,0:48:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,My donkey senses are tingling all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.09,0:48:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop that jug o' voodoo and let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.79,0:48:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It says，「Beauty Divine.」 How bad can it be？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.79,0:48:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，you're allergic to that stuff。You'll have a reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.68,0:48:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if you think that I'll be smearing Vapor Rub over your chest，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.18,0:48:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,think again！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.29,0:48:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boss，just in case there is something wrong with the potion…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.49,0:48:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,allow me to take the first sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.09,0:48:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would be an honor to lay my life on the line for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.70,0:48:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.40,0:48:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.39,0:48:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there'll be any animal testing，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.09,0:48:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.59,0:49:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the best friend's job。Now give me that bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.50,0:49:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you feel？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't feel any different.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.00,0:49:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I look any different？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.40,0:49:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You still look like an ass to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.39,0:49:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it doesn't work on donkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.79,0:49:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，here's to us，Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.10,0:49:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.09,0:49:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You drink that，there's no going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.09,0:49:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.89,0:49:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No more wallowing in the mud？- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.28,0:49:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No more itchy butt crack？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.50,0:49:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.49,0:49:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you love being an ogre！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.59,0:49:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.99,0:49:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I love Fiona more.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.80,0:49:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek，no！Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.30,0:49:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.40,0:49:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you grabbed the 「Farty Ever After」 potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.71,0:50:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.80,0:50:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or maybe Fiona and I were never meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.10,0:50:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh-oh。What did I tell you？I feel something coming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.90,0:50:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to die。I don't want to die。I don't want to die！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.19,0:50:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，sweet sister，mother of mercy。I'm melting！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.79,0:50:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm melting！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.60,0:50:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just the rain，Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.90,0:51:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。Things seem bad because it's dark and rainy
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.20,0:51:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Fiona's father hired a sleazy hitman to whack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.30,0:51:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be better in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.10,0:51:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll see…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.40,0:51:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ The sun'll come out… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.19,0:51:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Tomorrow ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.60,0:51:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Bet your bottom… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.61,0:51:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bet my bottom？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.21,0:51:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm coming，Elizabeth！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.11,0:51:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.70,0:51:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.70,0:51:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，boss。Let's shave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.50,0:51:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,D-Donkey？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.11,0:51:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you are！We missed you at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.60,0:51:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it，darling？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.81,0:51:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad…I've been thinking about what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.40,0:51:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm going to set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.01,0:52:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah！Excellent！That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a mistake to bring Shrek here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.60,0:52:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to go out and find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.30,0:52:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then we'll go back to the swamp where we belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.71,0:52:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona，please！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.41,0:52:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's not be rash，darling。You can't go anywhere right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.91,0:52:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.79,0:53:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I told you he was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.42,0:53:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at him！Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.51,0:53:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.81,0:53:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，sleepyhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.71,0:53:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning！We love your kitty！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.00,0:53:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh… My head…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.61,0:53:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，I fetched a pail of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.71,0:53:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.41,0:53:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,A cute button nose？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.11,0:53:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thick，wavy locks？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.72,0:53:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Taut，round buttocks？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.51,0:53:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm… I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.32,0:53:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gorgeous！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.32,0:53:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll say。- I'm Jill。What's your name？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.41,0:53:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.80,0:53:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.42,0:53:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。Are you from Europe？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.40,0:53:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're tense。- I want to rub his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.40,0:53:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I got it covered。- I don't have anything to rub.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.60,0:53:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.10,0:53:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you seen my donkey？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.11,0:53:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you calling donkey？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.12,0:53:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey？You're a…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.91,0:54:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,A stallion，baby！I can whinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.61,0:54:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.31,0:54:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at me，Shrek！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.31,0:54:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trotting！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.91,0:54:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's some quality potion。What's in that stuff？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.61,0:54:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Oh，don't take the potion，Mr。Boss，it's very bad.」
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.12,0:54:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Warning：Side effects may include burning，itching，oozing，weeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.81,0:54:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Not intended for heart patients or those with… nervous disorders.」
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.81,0:54:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trotting，I'm trotting in place！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.71,0:54:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.71,0:54:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Senor？「To make the effects of this potion permanent，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.31,0:54:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「the drinker must obtain
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.91,0:54:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,his true love's kiss by midnight.「
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.21,0:54:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Midnight？Why is it always midnight？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.22,0:54:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pick me！I'll be your true love！- I'll be your true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.81,0:54:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be true… enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.41,0:54:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，ladies，I already have a true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.11,0:54:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,And take it from me，Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.52,0:54:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are going to have one satisfied Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.52,0:54:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And let's face it。You are a lot easier on the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.42,0:55:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inside you're the same old mean，salty…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.21,0:55:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…cantankerous，foul，angry ogre you always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.62,0:55:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you're still the same annoying donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.62,0:55:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.43,0:55:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well…Look out，Princess。Here comes the new me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.72,0:55:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,First things first.We need to get you out of those clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.13,0:55:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ready？- Ready！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.01,0:55:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Driver，stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.01,0:55:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God！Help me，please！My racing days are over！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.82,0:55:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm blind！Tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.61,0:55:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will I ever play the violin again？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.62,0:55:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You poor creature！Is there anything I can do for you？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.02,0:55:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I guess there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.13,0:55:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take off the powdered wig and step away from your drawers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.12,0:55:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not bad。- Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.92,0:56:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Father？Is everything all right，Father？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.02,0:56:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，gentlemen！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.63,0:56:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someday，I will repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.83,0:56:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless，of course，I can't find you or if I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.92,0:56:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Turn and face the strange，Ch-Ch-Changes ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.72,0:56:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Don't wanna be a richer one ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.92,0:56:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Ch-Ch-Ch-Ch-Changes ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.03,0:56:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Turn and face the strange，Ch-Ch-Changes ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.13,0:56:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Just gonna have to be a different man ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.23,0:56:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Time may change me，But I can't trace time ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.53,0:57:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Halt！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.72,0:57:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell Princess Fiona
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.82,0:57:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,her husband，Sir Shrek，is here to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.72,0:57:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Still don't know what I was looking for ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.02,0:57:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And my time was running wild，a million dead-end streets ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.23,0:57:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Every time I thought I'd got it made ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.42,0:57:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ It seemed the taste was not so sweet ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.13,0:57:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Ch-Ch-Ch-Ch-Changes ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.83,0:57:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Turn and face the strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.13,0:57:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fiona？- Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.52,0:57:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Time may change me，But I can't trace time ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.14,0:57:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.63,0:57:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.73,0:57:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.62,0:57:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Princess！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.53,0:57:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.53,0:57:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow！That potion worked on you，too？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.82,0:57:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,What potion？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.13,0:57:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek and I took some magic potion。And well…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.43,0:58:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，we're sexy！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.63,0:58:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.42,0:58:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,For you，baby… I could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.23,0:58:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.53,0:58:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey，where is Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.03,0:58:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,He went inside looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.23,0:58:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.93,0:58:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.03,0:58:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.43,0:58:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to dance，pretty boy？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.24,0:58:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you going so soon？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.94,0:58:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you want to see your wife？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.44,0:58:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.84,0:58:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.43,0:58:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，Fiona。It is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.94,0:58:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to your voice？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.53,0:58:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,The potion changed a lot of things，Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.23,0:58:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But not the way I feel about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.63,0:58:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.93,0:58:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charming？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.33,0:58:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think so？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.64,0:58:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.43,0:58:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was so hoping you'd approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.93,0:59:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.64,0:59:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom，it's me，Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.44,0:59:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you never get a second chance at a first impression，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.23,0:59:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,but，well，what do you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.03,0:59:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona！Fiona！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.44,0:59:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.55,0:59:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fiona！- Fiona，Fiona！Ho-ho-ho！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.34,0:59:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shoot！I don't think they can hear us，pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.33,0:59:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you think you've already messed her life up enough？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.33,0:59:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just wanted her to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.65,0:59:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now she can be.And now she can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.44,0:59:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's finally found the prince of her dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.23,0:59:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,But look at me。Look what I've done for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.83,0:59:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time you stop living in a fairy tale，Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.74,0:59:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's a princess，and you're an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.34,1:00:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's something no amount of potion will ever change.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.54,1:00:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,But…I love her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.95,1:00:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you really love her…you'll let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.74,1:00:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？Senor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.04,1:00:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.54,1:00:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.14,1:00:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have had anything to do with this，
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.63,1:00:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,would you，Harold？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.04,1:00:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ People just ain't no good ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.64,1:00:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I think that's well understood ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.35,1:00:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you go，boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.65,1:00:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just leave the bottle，Doris.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.75,1:00:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Why the long face？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.44,1:01:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was all just a stupid mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.74,1:01:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never should have rescued her from that tower in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.95,1:01:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate Mondays.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.74,1:01:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe you'd walk away from the best thing that happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.55,1:01:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,What choice do I have？She loves that pretty boy
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.75,1:01:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.94,1:01:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Is he really that good-looking？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.34,1:01:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you kidding？He's gorgeous！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.55,1:01:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has a face that looks like it was carved by angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.53,1:01:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。He sounds dreamy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.03,1:01:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know shockingly，this isn't making me feel any better.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.65,1:01:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，guys。It's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.35,1:01:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad approve，and Fiona gets the man she's always dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.15,1:01:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.45,1:01:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except for you。I don't get it，Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.45,1:01:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You love Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.45,1:01:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。And that's why I have to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.04,1:01:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.66,1:02:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- is she here？- She's，uh… in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.45,1:02:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hello again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.25,1:02:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fairy Godmother。Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.24,1:02:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd better have a good reason for dragging us down here，Harold.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.95,1:02:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'm afraid Fiona isn't really… warming up to Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.05,1:02:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,FYl，not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.15,1:02:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，of course it's not，dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.66,1:02:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.66,1:02:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,how charming can I be when I have to pretend I'm
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.65,1:02:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,that dreadful ogre？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.95,1:02:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.95,1:02:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，it's nobody's fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.84,1:02:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's best if we just call the whole thing off，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.45,1:02:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.24,1:02:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't force someone to fall in love！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.64,1:02:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I beg to differ。I do it all the time！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.26,1:02:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have Fiona drink this
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.25,1:02:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,and she'll fall in love with the first man she kisses，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.95,1:02:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,which will be Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.15,1:02:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Umm… no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.65,1:02:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you say？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.05,1:02:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't。I won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.44,1:03:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes，you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.45,1:03:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you remember，I helped you with your happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.85,1:03:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I can take it away just as easily.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.55,1:03:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that what you want？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.35,1:03:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.55,1:03:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.94,1:03:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good boy。Now，we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.05,1:03:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to do Charming's hair before the ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.36,1:03:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,He can never get to the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.36,1:03:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's hopeless。He's all high in the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.85,1:03:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need someone to do the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.85,1:03:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。Thank you，Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.35,1:03:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mother？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.55,1:03:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um… Mary！A talking horse！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.15,1:03:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ogre！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.26,1:03:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop them！Thieves！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.86,1:03:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bandits！Stop them！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.76,1:03:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,The abs are fab and it's gluteus to the maximus
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.85,1:03:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,here at tonight's Far，Far Away Royal Ball blowout！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.86,1:03:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,The coaches are lined up as the cream of the crop pours out of them
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.56,1:03:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like Miss Muffet's curds and whey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.65,1:03:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone who's anyone has turned out
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.16,1:03:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，oh my，the outfits look gorgeous！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.75,1:04:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！Hansel and Gretel！What the heck are the crumbs for？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.25,1:04:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,And right behind them，Tom Thumb and Thumbelina！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.46,1:04:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，aren't they adorable！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.25,1:04:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here comes Sleeping Beauty！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.26,1:04:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tired old thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.06,1:04:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's this？Who's this？Who is this？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.86,1:04:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。It's the one，it's the only…It's the Fairy Godmother！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.74,1:04:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Far，Far Away！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.26,1:04:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I get a whoop whoop？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.86,1:04:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,May all your endings be happy and…Well，you know the rest！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.66,1:04:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be right back with the Royal Far，Far Away Ball
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.65,1:04:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,after these messages.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.86,1:04:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate these ball shows.They bore me to tears.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.75,1:04:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flip over to Wheel Of T orture！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.26,1:04:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not flipping anywhere，sir，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.66,1:04:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,until I see Shrek and Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.65,1:04:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whizzes on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.66,1:04:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，mice，pass me a buffalo wing！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.95,1:04:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，to your left。Your left！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.36,1:05:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonight on 「Knights」…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.95,1:05:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now here's a good show！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.66,1:05:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a white bronco heading east into the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.66,1:05:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Requesting backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.96,1:05:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time to teach these madcap mammals
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.66,1:05:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,their 「devil may mare」 attitudes just won't fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.66,1:05:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why you grabbing me？Police brutality！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.77,1:05:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I have to talk to Princess Fiona！- We warned you！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.56,1:05:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did someone let the cat out of the bag？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.56,1:05:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You capitalist pig dogs！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.67,1:05:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Catnip！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.67,1:05:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.46,1:05:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find Princess Fiona！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.16,1:05:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a donkey！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.16,1:05:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell her Shrek… I'm her husband，Shrek！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.66,1:05:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.06,1:05:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rewind it！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.46,1:05:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm her husband，Shrek！Ow！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.07,1:06:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darling？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.26,1:06:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah。I thought I might find you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.87,1:06:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about a nice hot cup of tea before the ball？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.86,1:06:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.47,1:06:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,The whole Kingdom's turned out to celebrate your marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.76,1:06:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's just one problem。That's not my husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.96,1:06:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，look at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.36,1:06:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，he is a bit different，but people change for the ones they love.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.47,1:06:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd be surprised how much I changed for your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.47,1:06:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Change？He's completely lost his mind！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.76,1:06:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why not come down to the ball and give him another chance？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.16,1:06:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You might find you like this new Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.47,1:07:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's the old one I fell in love with，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.58,1:07:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd give anything to have him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.07,1:07:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darling。That's mine。Decaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.16,1:07:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otherwise I'm up all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.76,1:07:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.16,1:07:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got to get out of here！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.66,1:07:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't lock us up like this！Let me go！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.47,1:07:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about my Miranda rights？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.67,1:07:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're supposed to say I have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.67,1:07:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody said I have the right to remain silent！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.47,1:07:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.67,1:07:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you lack is the capacity.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.17,1:07:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must hold on before l，too，go totally mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.07,1:07:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.36,1:07:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.67,1:07:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.57,1:07:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gingy！Pinocchio！Get us out of here！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.47,1:07:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire in ze hole！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.18,1:08:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out below！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.96,1:08:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick！Tell a lie！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.07,1:08:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What should I say？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.68,1:08:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything，but quick！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.97,1:08:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say something crazy like 「I'm wearing ladies' underwear！」
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.67,1:08:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am wearing ladies' underwear.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.07,1:08:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.08,1:08:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I most certainly am not！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.78,1:08:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks like you most certainly am are！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.88,1:08:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.88,1:08:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.79,1:08:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a thong！！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.97,1:08:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oww！They're briefs
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.68,1:08:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are not。- Are too！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.68,1:08:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are not！- Are too！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.38,1:08:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we go。Hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.58,1:08:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.67,1:09:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.18,1:09:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Puss！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.98,1:09:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pardon me，would you mind letting me go？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.47,1:09:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.47,1:09:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quit messing around！We've got to stop that kiss！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.08,1:09:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you was going to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.17,1:09:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was，but I can't let them do this to Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.68,1:09:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boom！That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.68,1:09:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look who's coming around！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.89,1:09:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's impossible！We'll never get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.67,1:09:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,The castle's guarded。There's a moat and everything！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.07,1:09:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Folks，it looks like we're up chocolate creek without a Popsicle stick.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.89,1:09:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.69,1:09:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you still know the Muffin Man？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.67,1:09:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，sure！He's down on Drury Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.48,1:09:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.58,1:09:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because we're gonna need flour。Lots and lots of flour.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.87,1:09:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gingy！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.48,1:09:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire up the ovens，Muffin Man！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.68,1:09:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got a big order to fill！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.28,1:10:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's alive！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.29,1:10:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run，run，run，as fast you can！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.07,1:10:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，baby，go！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.29,1:10:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,There it is，Mongo！To the castle！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.69,1:10:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you great stupid pastry！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.69,1:10:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.58,1:10:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mongo！Down here！Look at the pony！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.48,1:10:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right！Follow the pretty pony！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.18,1:10:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretty pony wants to play at the castle！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.48,1:10:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretty pony.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.77,1:10:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen。Presenting Princess Fiona
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.09,1:10:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,and her new husband，Prince Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.19,1:11:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek，what are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.39,1:11:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just playing the part，Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.38,1:11:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that glitter on your lips？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.88,1:11:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mm。Cherry flavored。Want to taste？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.38,1:11:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ugh！What is with you？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.09,1:11:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，Muffin Cake…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.89,1:11:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,C Minor，put it in C Minor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.69,1:11:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.68,1:11:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to dedicate this song to…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.58,1:11:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Princess Fiona
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.68,1:11:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Prince Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.09,1:11:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona，my Princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.69,1:11:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you honor me with a dance？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.29,1:11:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Where have all the good men gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.67,1:11:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And where are all the gods？∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.88,1:11:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Where's the streetwise Hercules ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.69,1:11:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ To fight the rising odds？∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.49,1:11:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since when do you dance？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.28,1:12:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona，my dearest，if there's one thing I know，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.18,1:12:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's that love is full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.19,1:12:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Late at night I toss and I turn And I dream of what I need ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.29,1:12:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hit it！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.59,1:12:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I need a Hero… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.69,1:12:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，big fella！Let's crash this party！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.69,1:12:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man the catapults！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.28,1:12:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aim！Fire！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.88,1:12:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves！Ooh！Purty！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.00,1:12:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not the gumdrop button！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.99,1:12:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Incoming！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.40,1:12:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha-ha！All right！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.10,1:13:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Somewhere after midnight In my wildest fantasy ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.30,1:13:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，Mongo！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.19,1:13:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man the cauldrons！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.09,1:13:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,After you，Mongo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.99,1:13:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it！Heave-ho！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.29,1:13:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch out！Shrek！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.90,1:13:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,More heat，less foam！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.89,1:13:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Up where the mountains Meet the heavens above ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.90,1:13:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Out where the lightning Splits the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.10,1:13:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I could swear there is someone Somewhere watching me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.00,1:13:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heave！Ho！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.40,1:13:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,No…！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.30,1:14:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.50,1:14:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.70,1:14:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.69,1:14:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He needs me！Let me go！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.60,1:14:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.40,1:14:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Puss！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.89,1:15:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Your lady needs you！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.40,1:15:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today，I repay my debt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.90,1:15:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,On guard！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.70,1:15:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ He's gotta be strong And he's gotta be fast ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.20,1:15:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And he's gotta be fresh From the fight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.31,1:15:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I need a Hero… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.70,1:15:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.10,1:15:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you！Back away from my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.50,1:15:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.51,1:15:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You couldn't just go back to your swamp
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.71,1:15:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,and leave well enough alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.71,1:15:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.90,1:15:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pigs und blanket！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.50,1:15:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pinocchio！Get the wand！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.71,1:15:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see London！I see France！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.70,1:15:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a real boy！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.51,1:16:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Catch！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.21,1:16:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.89,1:16:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a real boy。Aah！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.51,1:16:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's mine！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.21,1:16:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pray for mercy，from Puss…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.11,1:16:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.51,1:16:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's taken the potion！Kiss her now！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.71,1:16:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.31,1:17:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.21,1:17:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.42,1:17:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harold！You were supposed to give her the potion！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.51,1:17:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I guess I gave her the wrong tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.62,1:17:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mommy！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.62,1:17:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mommy？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.51,1:17:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you。Ogres don't live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.52,1:17:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Dad！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.52,1:17:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harold
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.72,1:17:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is he…？- Yup.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.01,1:17:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,He croaked.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.01,1:17:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harold？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.21,1:17:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.21,1:18:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd hoped you'd never see me like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.72,1:18:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And he gave you a hard time！- Donkey！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.22,1:18:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，he's right。I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.42,1:18:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,To both of you.I only wanted what was best for Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.41,1:18:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I can see now…she already has it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.82,1:18:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shrek，Fiona…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.01,1:18:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you accept an old frog's apologies…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.41,1:18:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,and my blessing？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.31,1:18:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harold？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.41,1:18:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Lillian.I just wish I could be the man you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.82,1:18:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're more that man today than you ever were…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.82,1:18:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,warts and all.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.71,1:18:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boss！The Happily Ever After Potion！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.51,1:18:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Midnight！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.52,1:18:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fiona。Is this what you want？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.33,1:18:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- To be this way forever？- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.32,1:19:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because if you kiss me now…we can stay like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.62,1:19:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd do that… For me？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.11,1:19:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.72,1:19:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want what any princess wants.To live happily ever after…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.42,1:19:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,with the ogre I married.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.92,1:19:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever happens，I must not cry！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.03,1:19:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You cannot make me cry！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.62,1:20:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No，no。Aaah！Ow.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.63,1:20:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。You still look like a noble steed to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.02,1:20:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，where were we？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.63,1:20:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh。I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.72,1:20:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Isn't we supposed to be having a fiesta？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.23,1:20:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uno，dos，quatro，
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.23,1:20:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,hit it！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.92,1:21:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Puss and Donkey，y'all…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.53,1:21:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She's into superstitions ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.33,1:21:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Black cats and voodoo dolls ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.02,1:21:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sing it，Puss！- ∮ I feel a premonition ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.73,1:21:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ That girl's gonna make me fall ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.82,1:21:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we go！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.93,1:21:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She's into new sensations ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.73,1:21:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ New kicks in the candlelight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.23,1:21:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She's got a new addiction ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.03,1:21:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ For every day and night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.53,1:21:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She'll make you take your clothes off ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.84,1:21:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And go dancing in the rain ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.13,1:21:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She'll make you live her crazy life ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.24,1:21:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But she'll take away your pain ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.84,1:21:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Like a bullet to your brain ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.33,1:21:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Upside inside out ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.93,1:21:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.93,1:21:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey gorgeous！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.33,1:21:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.03,1:21:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Her lips are devil red ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.43,1:21:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And her skin's the color of mocha ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.92,1:21:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She will wear you out ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.93,1:21:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loc。Oh！She livin' it loca！∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.63,1:22:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.24,1:22:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Say it one more time now！- ∮ Living the vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.33,1:22:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Donkey，that's Spanish！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.23,1:22:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She'll push and pull you down ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.83,1:22:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.54,1:22:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She will wear you out ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.23,1:22:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.84,1:22:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.13,1:22:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She'll push and pull you down ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.53,1:22:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living the vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.03,1:22:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Her lips are devil red ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.64,1:22:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And her skin 's the color of mocha ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.13,1:22:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ She will wear you out ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.83,1:22:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.53,1:22:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.34,1:22:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.93,1:22:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.44,1:24:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ OH…balaso… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.74,1:24:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ All by myself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.74,1:24:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ OH…balaso… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.24,1:24:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ All by myself anymore… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.14,1:24:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amigo，we are off to the Kit-Kat Club.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.74,1:24:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，join us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.14,1:24:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，compadre。I'm… I'm not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.33,1:24:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will cheer you up！Find you a nice burro！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.34,1:24:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，baby！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.55,1:24:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，that's my girl！Yeah！All right！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.93,1:24:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Baby，where you been？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.35,1:24:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.64,1:24:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should've stayed。But Shrek had this thing he had to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.45,1:24:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Say it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.04,1:24:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you talking about？Are you serious？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.85,1:24:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Papa！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.25,1:24:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Papa！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.75,1:25:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at our little mutant babies！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.75,1:25:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got to get a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:59.17,Title,0,0,0,0,,《怪物史瑞克2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个远的要命的王国
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.19,0:01:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王与王后生了一个美丽的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,王国里的每一个人都非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.39,0:01:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是到太阳下山以后…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王与王后才发现… 公主被恐怖的咒语所诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天一到晚上咒语就开始生效
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是心急如焚的 国王和王后向神仙教母救助
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,神仙教母要他们 把公主锁在高塔上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待超酷的白马王子前来吻她…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,破除咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,白马王子经历千辛万苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,走过夜晚冷得要死 白天热得要命的沙漠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,花上了好几天好几夜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒着生命的危险…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.19,0:01:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于… 到了恶龙守护的高塔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,全天下…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,最勇敢…最英俊的王子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在命运的安排下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.69,0:02:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他香吻…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,将破除可怕的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上高塔顶端的公主房间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找房间内…美丽的睡美人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拉开薄薄的纱想要亲吻公主…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是… 公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…差点被狼吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去度蜜月了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,度蜜月…跟谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.59,0:02:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她说 到底怎么回事 宝贝？∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 怎么回事？我哪里会知道 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 或许是我恋爱了吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 要多久我才能痊愈？∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 治愈 因为我无法坐视不管 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果是爱 是爱情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 令我想回头看看自己 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可是我对爱情一窍不通 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快一点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 世界将跟随着你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 人人都在追求爱情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所以我说我是一个滚动的雪球 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 滚进洋溢爱情的春天 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 融入蓝天 迎接旭日 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 光辉闪亮的爱情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 宝贝 我投降 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 即使化作草莓冰淇淋 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这份爱永不止歇 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这并不是甜言蜜语 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我将永不逃离你的爱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:04:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这些光芒预示着我们将不再孤独 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 永不孤寂 永不 永不 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再跳高一点 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 假如你觉得轻松 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们曾经相爱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们意外地陷入情网 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 意外地陷入情网 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 意外地陷入情网 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 意外的相爱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 意外地陷入情网 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 意外地陷入情网 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 意外地陷入情网 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 意外 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 恋爱了 恋爱了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 恋爱了 恋爱了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 意外的相爱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 恋爱了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我在恋爱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:04:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到家里的感觉真好！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.22,0:05:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于剩下你跟我…还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.81,0:05:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 走一起不一定会更好… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克！费欧娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你们好开心哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来抱抱好吗 史瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这可爱的小妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈… 还有你 史太太
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要给我来个亲亲呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.61,0:05:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子 你在这里干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.81,0:05:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你照顾爱的小窝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 你是说… 你来帮我整理信件
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有浇花吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀 还有帮你喂金鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本没有养鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在养啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只叫史瑞克 这只叫费欧娜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是史瑞克最调皮了 不乖就打屁屁…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢… 你看现在很晚了耶 你该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶… 蜜月旅行有什么好玩的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来玩骑马打仗…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 驴子 你不是应该回家陪小龙女吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…对哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最近的情绪好像不太稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我还是搬来 跟你们一起住好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道我们一直 都很欢迎你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是费欧娜跟我已经结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一点时间 可以彼此在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了 别再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不用担心 我会尽忠职守
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会让任何人来打扰你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.51,0:06:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你打扰我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧… 我走就是了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真酷 此处不留爷 自有留爷处
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天吃香的喝辣的… 没有什么了不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事的 对了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚到哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！我想起来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了！你们要在一起的 我不打扰你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是外面那些人没人理啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别吹了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的费欧娜公主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,奉天承运 远的要命王国国王召曰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将奉旨出席皇室舞会 以庆祝你的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,届时 国王将会在 舞会中赐福祝福你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的…呃… 白马王子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你的远的要命 王国国王与王后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是你的父王母后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王跟母后？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,白马王子？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.41,0:07:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇室舞会…我也要去！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才不去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到你的时候会… 吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看你现在的样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们是会吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:07:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们必竟是我的父母 他们爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要担心 他们也会爱你的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哦 等哪天我是彭永俊 你不是如花再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们才不会以貌取人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么他刚才介绍我的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,语气那么不屑啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托… 你不试试看怎么会知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？看会不会被丢石头？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 他们只是想要祝福你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么 我干嘛需要他们的祝福啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想成为我的家人 就需要！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我想成为你们家人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呀？你娶了我就是啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 原来你早有预谋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跟你说了 你去不去？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 不会有搞头的了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝对不去 也不要再说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.51,0:08:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点了 史瑞克。不然会塞车哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 这里交给我们没有问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 来走…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来走了…来走来走 把头抬高！一下大叫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把烦恼忘掉 又跟我一起唱一起跳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起听笑 一起大叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:28.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（远的要命王国 700英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:40.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（远的要命王国 200英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…我们到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还…没
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.03,0:09:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没到！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们到了没？- 还没…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:09:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样很嫩耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就因为这样大家不喜欢你 - 就因为这样大家不喜欢驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 算你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要跟你说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要走多久啊 什么烂车嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该装部卡拉OK
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去的是… 远得要命王国
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,远得要命王国 还真是…远得…要命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是真的很无聊嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊… 那就自己去找乐子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,5分钟就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.53,0:10:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能闭上你的驴嘴？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要5分钟就好！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…我们到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎莅临 远的要命王国）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来我们每天都要吃好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼肉酒 吃到饱！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.53,0:11:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 辣妹！等一下我回来接你们哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（神仙教母 让你幸福快乐！）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次想后悔也来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 好吧 我们谈谈吧 谈谈吧… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一只驴子耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 说吧 说吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 妹妹 帅哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴那顶帽子 很像单留美耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,灰姑娘？游泳池耶！电影明星！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全国期待已久 美丽的费欧娜公主
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她的新婚夫婿驾到…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于到了.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…你们先过去好了… 我去泊车
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妳还觉得来这里是对的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看…父王跟母后 看到我们都很开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个丑女人是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想应该是我们的女儿吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:14:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的小乖乖吗？怎么变成丑八怪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是应该被白马王子亲吻 破除咒语变漂亮了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是他不像白马王子 可是他们看起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心啰？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了 也看到了他们了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是趁他们没有抓狂前 赶快落跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我父母耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 他们把你锁在高塔上耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是为了我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！快点进去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快躲到里面 假装不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛 我们应该…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 趁他们还没看清楚 赶快落跑…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克！不要这样！我们一定会…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好惨啊 我就不相信…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我真的… 真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,想…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,母后！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们介绍我老公 …史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一看就知道费欧娜 这么漂亮是遗传谁的了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,打嗝总比放屁好 对不对 费欧娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概不对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么名单上没有我？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我是谁都不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…大家好啊… 差点迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真的很难找耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行不行 臭驴子 下去！快下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:16:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 父王 没关系 没关系 他是我朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也有帮我对付那只喷火龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…就是我 高贵的「神驹」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 小二 帮我拿菜单来…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.05,0:16:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…史瑞克…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？哦 抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤很好喝 母后大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.75,0:16:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 不对 是这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 费欧娜 你现在都住那里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个… 史瑞克有自己的土地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对 老公？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在一个美丽的森林里面…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有很多的松鼠 还有天鹅…还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在说你那个沼泽啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个住在沼泽的妖怪 喔 多传奇啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的环境… 应该蛮适合多养几个孩子的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说这些还太早了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错！我才要开始吃东西了呢！- 哈咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这话是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是好人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看他是个好妖怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…要去尿尿了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,主菜上桌了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 我可以憋一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,用餐愉快！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 墨西哥菜！我的最爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我们大家不要光顾 在这里抬杆 大家开动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就不客气啰…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们将来你们给我生个孙子 应该会是个…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,妖怪…没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情没那么严重嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 哈洛？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对对 当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他能够证明他不会吃小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.56,0:17:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我们对小孩承诺的方式 就是把他锁在高塔…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克 拜托！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那么做是因为我爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:18:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 爱到还找喷火龙来当保姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不懂.你又不是她父亲！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人在一起 吃顿团圆饭还真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈洛！- 史瑞克！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 费欧娜 - 费欧娜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 母后！- 哈洛！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.57,0:19:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你悲伤的眼泪告诉我 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有我拯救受伤的心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我知道每位公主都 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 想过得非常快乐地… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔…天那…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…好大了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我是你的神仙教母啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有神仙教母？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘…好了 不要担心 我是来帮助你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻…轻…的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 挥动我的魔仗 你烦恼雨消云散 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 挥挥手 深处光芒就会有… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 多情的王子随你换 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 老鼠做起了高级洋装 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 和那富贵雕的玻璃鞋 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 流行服装游荡在你的腰 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再帮你搞定所有流行资信 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 会让你穿最流行服装 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我让你流行我让你炫！∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是王子最爱的女性 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他们会对你找藉口 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 想要幸福快乐请找费欧娜 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一辆外表不逊的马车 性感马夫来相爱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 还帮你去除掉赤斑蛀牙更美白 粽子老皮别缠我… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 真是万岁！给你一些宝贝！∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.17,0:20:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 揉揉眼 松松肩 梳梳头发让王子迷恋 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 口红鲜艳眼影细 还有王子性感的小动作 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.97,0:20:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别浪费好机会 你和王子一起比翼双飞 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:21:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 数一数 小珍珠 这一生 相撕守 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别害臊 会更好 同受爱情的美妙 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 情人节爱情夜 来点烧味更点缀 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 揉揉眼 松松肩 梳梳头发让王子迷恋… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.78,0:21:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢你神仙教母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 这些我都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 随便你 反正我们也不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.27,0:21:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你房间还送小狗？我的房间只送沐浴露耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,神仙教母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位家具…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来介绍我的老公… 史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.07,0:21:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么时候发生的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为史瑞克他救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不应该是这样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！又多了一个亲戚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是来帮我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以帮忙打包
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿衣服 我们走人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:21:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？走人？我才不想走.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:21:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候决定的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我一来就决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用不用 不用道歉 反正我也要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过要记得啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你需要我…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.37,0:22:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福… 只需要一滴眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.69,0:22:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 我们现在已经很幸福了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.47,0:22:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福幸福好幸福…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得出来…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.07,0:22:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看你干的好事 - 怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就说过我们不该来的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你至少可以先试着 跟我父王好好相处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 就算我愿意想跟他好好相处
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父王也不见得愿意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你有没想过…问问我？看我到底想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啊 请问要我帮你打包吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.08,0:22:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是不可理喻！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直野蛮得象个…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊说啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个妖物！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.09,0:22:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子清醒一点…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你父母接不接受 我就是个妖怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.48,0:23:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再告诉你 公主 这是谁也没办法改变的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.19,0:23:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是为你做了改变 史瑞克 你自己想想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好威风哦 史瑞克 「我就是个妖物…」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道会这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.69,0:23:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然了 都是你引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信你会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.59,0:23:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想 妖怪是他又不是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.79,0:23:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛 你不觉得你管得也太多了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.19,0:24:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是费欧娜自己的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.39,0:24:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 可是她应该选择 我们帮她挑的王子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你真的希望我祝福… 这…这个…妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜希望啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.09,0:24:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不这么做 她绝不会原谅你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.49,0:24:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再失去我们的女儿了 哈咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你忘了… 爱情都是不可预测的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.68,0:24:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了… 当我们年轻的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.18,0:24:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在水莲池畔散步…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.49,0:24:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,花儿朵朵绽放
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的初吻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.19,0:24:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道还不明白我们的女儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.69,0:24:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嫁给了怪物吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.50,0:24:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把他当怪物就好了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.59,0:24:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好！很好！我们就假装一切都很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是完美得不得了！反正再坏还能坏到哪去呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.09,0:24:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 哈洛.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.00,0:24:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.08,0:24:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 没什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.59,0:24:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我的老毛病又犯了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.38,0:24:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到外面去做做伸展运动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.29,0:24:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好进来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要聊一聊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.19,0:24:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 神仙教母… 我已经要睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.69,0:25:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连安眠药都吃 现在整个人昏昏沉沉的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.50,0:25:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…不过… 我们可以长话短说
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.48,0:25:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,…干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.69,0:25:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.89,0:25:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 有什么事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.28,0:25:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得我的儿子… 白马王子？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.69,0:25:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅哥…真的是你？天那…好多年没见了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 你什么时候回来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.00,0:25:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概就在5分钟以前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.99,0:25:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我忍受刺骨寒风 炽热的沙漠之后
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.80,0:25:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我爬上了高塔顶端…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.09,0:25:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静冷静冷静 让妈妈来就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他忍受刺骨寒风 还有炽热的沙漠之后
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.10,0:25:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上了该死的最高塔里头 最该死的那间房间…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.09,0:25:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是… - 你猜猜他看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.48,0:25:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看见一只 不男不女的大野狼…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.69,0:25:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说 公主…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.49,0:25:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…已经结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.09,0:25:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这不是我的错 是帅哥动作太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.20,0:25:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我停车！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次可是你逼我做出 我真的不想做的事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.49,0:26:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好！欢迎来到「麦当鸡」 请问要点些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害我减肥失败 这下你高兴了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要两个香鸡卷 不要梅奶汁 我还要炸盐鸡…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.19,0:26:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要点快乐儿童餐
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份快乐儿童餐 哈洛 要薯条吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.70,0:26:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…我不用 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用装了 要什么就说嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.71,0:26:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不用 我不饿…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.69,0:26:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,神仙教母 这是你点的东西.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.90,0:26:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是快乐儿童餐附赠的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.30,0:26:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛 我们都讲好了对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.60,0:26:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你应该 也不希望我反悔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.29,0:26:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不希望
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.89,0:26:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 换句话说 费欧娜一定会嫁给我儿子啰？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.80,0:26:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我！哈洛 这是最好的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.60,0:26:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只对你的女儿好…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.50,0:26:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对整个王国都好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.19,0:27:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我应该怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.51,0:27:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,用用你的脑袋想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.70,0:27:28.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（毒苹果酒吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进吧 国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.00,0:27:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我喜欢我的城镇 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.51,0:27:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来一点毒药 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.30,0:28:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有人知道… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.01,0:28:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.01,0:28:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像看过你？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.51,0:28:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…不可能吧 你一定是认错人了.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.40,0:28:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…不好意思 我要找灰姑娘的丑姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.70,0:28:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…就是你啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.60,0:28:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的 我想要找人 帮我解决一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.01,0:28:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.91,0:28:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能算是人了… 他是…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.21,0:28:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个…妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.30,0:28:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老头 老实跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.51,0:28:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,全王国只有一个家伙 能干这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.50,0:28:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 他不喜欢人家打扰他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.62,0:28:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 要去哪找他？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.31,0:28:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 你好？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.21,0:28:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁这么大胆敢进我房间…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.11,0:28:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 希望没有打扰到你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.21,0:28:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你可以解决关于… 妖怪的问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:28:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.00,0:29:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我的收费可是很高的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.31,0:29:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些… 够吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.90,0:29:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将为你献上… 我物超所值的服务…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.61,0:29:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 这个妖怪在哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.21,0:29:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每个人都知道 我的心情跌落谷底 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.72,0:29:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所有人都劝我 别想这么多 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.82,0:29:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 算了吧 别想这么多 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.91,0:30:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我累了 需要一点时间睡 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.51,0:30:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也该让马儿休息了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.31,0:30:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我陷入沉思 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.92,0:30:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 车轮飞快地转动着 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.32,0:30:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所有人都劝我 别想这么多 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.02,0:30:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的骑士 希望你能接受这个礼物 让我表达我的感激
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.01,0:30:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的日记
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.52,0:31:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡美人明天要办通宵派对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.32,0:31:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是父王说我不可以去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.91,0:31:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳下山以后 他都不让我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.71,0:31:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王说 我必须离开这一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是要我去念技术学校吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.81,0:31:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,母后说 等我长大了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.01,0:31:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,英俊的白马王子 就会到塔里来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.62,0:31:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我带回家里团聚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.52,0:31:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此过着幸福快乐的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.82,0:31:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要嫁给白马王子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,白马王子太太
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,白马王子太太
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.22,0:31:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,白马王子太太…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.91,0:31:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 希望我没有嘈到你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有没有 我正看…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.22,0:31:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…恐怖小说
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才的态度非常恶劣 我希望你能接受我的道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.72,0:31:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,道歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:31:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一时糊涂才会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.62,0:32:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意当作一切都没有发生 让我们从头开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.51,0:32:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.72,0:32:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不… 请叫我父王
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.83,0:32:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩个态度都不好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.73,0:32:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们需要多一点 时间好好了解对方
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.03,0:32:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正希望你明天早上 能跟我一起去打猎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.53,0:32:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受父子亲密时间…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.32,0:32:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想费欧娜 一定会很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.72,0:32:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就约好 早上七点半在榕树下见
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.43,0:32:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要硬撑了 我们迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.42,0:32:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能会迷路 我们完全是按照国王的指示呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么说的 往树林里最远最暗的方向走…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会经过一堆长得 像姚明那么高的树…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.52,0:32:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后会看到像 小亮哥那么矮的树…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.53,0:32:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个地方 我们已经走过三遍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.13,0:33:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己不想 找人问路的好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.13,0:33:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.13,0:33:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好不容易有机会可以跟 费欧娜的父王合好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.33,0:33:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我却跟你在森林里迷路！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.63,0:33:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干吗把气出在我身上？我只是想帮忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.33,0:33:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了… 我了…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.72,0:33:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我也没有怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.82,0:33:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很希望 能跟她的父王好好相处
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.02,0:33:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 我们快点去找岳父大人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.03,0:33:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.13,0:33:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想化解尴尬的气氛 可是你也不用出怪声吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.23,0:33:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都秀逗了 我哪有？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.13,0:33:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别撑了 你是不是又想…抱抱啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.53,0:33:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,童话驴子哪会出这种怪声？你把我当成是什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.92,0:33:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈… 够胆的话就不必怕我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.13,0:33:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看！有只小猫耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.23,0:33:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！史瑞克！他有家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.73,0:33:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是只猫 驴子 来啊…来来来…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.13,0:34:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来 小猫咪…来啊… 快过来…小猫咪…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.42,0:34:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕！史瑞克 我来救你了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.03,0:34:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.23,0:34:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他弄走！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.13,0:34:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄…弄走！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.13,0:34:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克！小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.52,0:34:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄走！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克！别动！史瑞克！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.04,0:34:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.13,0:34:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.54,0:34:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,正中要害…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.43,0:34:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,求饶吧 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.23,0:34:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乃大名鼎鼎的…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.92,0:34:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…靴猫剑客
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.52,0:34:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你这只猫！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.63,0:34:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,噎到毛了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.03,0:35:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的好恶心哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.43,0:35:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉我们该怎么解决它？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.13,0:35:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得拿它的剑 把小鸡鸡割掉好了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.43,0:35:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免野猫越来越多
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.94,0:35:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈咪呀 我求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.03,0:35:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拜托你 不要把私人恩怨给扯进来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.63,0:35:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做都是为了家人 我上有高堂老母…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.24,0:35:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老爸过着吃垃圾的日子 我还有很多弟妹要养…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.44,0:35:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王要给我一大笔钱 要我…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.93,0:35:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等…费欧娜的父王 给你钱叫你来杀我？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.43,0:35:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯子国王？是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.85,0:35:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 父王的祝福我是无福消受了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.25,0:35:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 史瑞克。看开点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.23,0:35:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不管谁看到你都想杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.04,0:35:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.44,0:35:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是白马王子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.34,0:35:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概就可以 让费欧娜好过一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.44,0:35:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 国王就是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.04,0:35:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…抱歉 就当我刚刚什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.64,0:35:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克 费欧娜知道 你对她用情很深
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.53,0:36:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真的要我改 我也不是不能改
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.13,0:36:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的… 我真的希望我能让她开心
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.73,0:36:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.34,0:36:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.33,0:36:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要一滴眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.64,0:36:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子 赶快想想 你这辈子最难过的事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.24,0:36:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔… 你要我从何说起好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.34,0:36:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,目屎流不停啊！有一天父子俩个牵着我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.84,0:36:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来一起走得好好的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.84,0:36:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一下子老爸上来骑我 一下子又换儿子上来骑我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.55,0:36:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,被这样轮完以后…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.54,0:36:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,干脆两个人上来骑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.84,0:36:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为想骑就骑哦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.75,0:36:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么这么没面子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.45,0:36:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是啊 驴子 我要你掉眼泪！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.94,0:36:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦… 我好好的干吗要掉眼泪？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.85,0:36:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你难过 但是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.53,0:36:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这只心肠狠毒的猫…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.15,0:36:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始录了吗？开始了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.74,0:36:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是神仙教母
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.54,0:37:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没有办法 接听你的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.03,0:37:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想找我 做心理咨询
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.14,0:37:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意跟你 约时间谈谈你的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.74,0:37:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要幸福快乐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.54,0:37:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不想去做点 心理咨询啊 驴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.75,0:37:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊！这还差不多…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.05,0:37:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子跟史瑞克 又要再度出发冒险了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.55,0:37:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们一起走… 你别挡路… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.95,0:37:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 妖怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.04,0:37:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要对你另眼相看！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.04,0:37:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,少说屁话 要么就加入
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.84,0:37:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.05,0:37:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下比尔… 为了报答你的饶命之恩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.84,0:37:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会竭尽所能帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.73,0:37:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,想死啊…最会打屁扯蛋的 动物就是我了 不需要你了…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.24,0:37:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 史瑞克！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.14,0:37:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.75,0:37:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史瑞克！- 不要这样嘛 驴子 你看看他
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.25,0:37:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还穿可爱的小鞋鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上有多少猫是穿鞋子的？对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.35,0:37:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要他嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.15,0:37:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可笑耶
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.96,0:38:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这声音好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.66,0:38:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱个屁！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.94,0:38:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样 驴子 开心一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.95,0:38:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.55,0:38:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,心情不好的人叫 心情好的人开心？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.55,0:38:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.85,0:38:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.05,0:38:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.04,0:38:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两块布料看起来蛮喜气的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.04,0:38:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对 哈洛？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.06,0:38:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…对对… 喜气…喜气…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.55,0:38:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你不关心你女儿的婚礼 可是好歹也要假装一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.55,0:38:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 莉雅 我会觉得我无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.05,0:38:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他们根本 就不打算来参加
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.45,0:38:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,母后 父王
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.15,0:38:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.55,0:38:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…你说什么？好好好…我来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.25,0:38:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,母后 你有看到史瑞克吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.65,0:39:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有耶 你应该去问你的父王
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.66,0:39:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量讲得慢一点 简单一点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.55,0:39:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今天早上有点迟钝
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.15,0:39:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要什么吗 国王陛下？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.95,0:39:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…要…太好吃了 这是什么菜啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.55,0:39:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是要拿去给狗吃的早餐 国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.84,0:39:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…对 非常好 快端去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.65,0:39:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王 你有看到史瑞克吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.25,0:39:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…没看来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.64,0:39:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他大概是 躲到哪避风头去了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.05,0:39:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得跟你起冲突
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.65,0:39:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩个 昨天晚上嗓门还真大
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.06,0:39:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都听到啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.85,0:39:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,全国的人都听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.15,0:39:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 毕竟这是他的本性…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.56,0:39:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 本性就粗鲁
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.74,0:39:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.55,0:39:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说… 你对他的态度也很不友善
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.55,0:39:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要我怎么样？你看看他把你弄成什么样子了？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.06,0:39:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我是什么样子 他都会爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.06,0:39:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你会替我高兴呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.56,0:39:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我满脑子在想 怎么做才对你最好？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.26,0:39:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你也该为自己打算一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.25,0:40:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔…真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.96,0:40:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼房子啊？我们还是快闪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.36,0:40:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是神仙教母的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.95,0:40:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方是远得要命王国 最大的魔药制造厂
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.56,0:40:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还不快进去 请她帮我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.06,0:40:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…做法啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.56,0:40:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,大哥 你还真幽默啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.35,0:40:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！我是来找…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.05,0:40:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙女教母
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.26,0:40:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 她不在
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.45,0:40:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰罗 我要咖啡和火鸡三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.06,0:41:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.15,0:41:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 神仙教母 马上来！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.54,0:41:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她今天不打算见客！好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.35,0:41:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓 兄弟 我们是工会来的.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.57,0:41:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,工会？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.87,0:41:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几个呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.07,0:41:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是魔法与魔术工会 所派来的代表
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.47,0:41:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.97,0:41:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会不会觉得在这里 不受重视而且被压榨呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.15,0:41:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.36,0:41:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至连健保都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.15,0:41:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们连健保都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.06,0:41:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们要到处看一看了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.36,0:41:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.57,0:41:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不要让神仙教母 知道我们在这里比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.66,0:41:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的意思吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.56,0:41:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够了 - 当然了 进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.66,0:42:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一滴…欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.67,0:42:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…好坏哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.86,0:42:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点…热情
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.56,0:42:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一些些… 忘情水
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.96,0:42:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.37,0:42:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这样闯进来 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.87,0:42:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个妖怪 跑到这来干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.66,0:42:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为… 费欧娜看起来好像不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.36,0:42:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主遇上妖怪 不会有好下场的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.95,0:42:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我来帮你找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.36,0:42:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 这…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.67,0:42:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主篇… 灰姑娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.96,0:42:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 从此过着幸福快乐的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.07,0:42:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔…没有妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.07,0:43:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看看 白雪公主…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.87,0:43:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,英俊的王子 喔… 没有怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.67,0:43:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡美人 喔…没有怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.97,0:43:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖果屋… 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.97,0:43:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,姆指姑娘… 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.38,0:43:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金鸟 小美人鱼 小妇人…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.88,0:43:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有！没有！没有！通通没有！你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.37,0:43:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有幸福快乐的故事里 都没有妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.17,0:43:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,老太婆 你给我听着…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.17,0:43:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要用你又肥又脏的 垃圾甜不辣手指着我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.66,0:43:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的火鸡三明治和咖啡 喔… 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.17,0:43:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…没关系 我们刚好也要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.26,0:43:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉浪费您这么多时间 仙女教母
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.86,0:43:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了…走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.17,0:43:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们走了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.97,0:43:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛苦了 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.87,0:44:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要认真工作不要偷懒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.48,0:44:07.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（药水室）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.77,0:44:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你跟你的臭鞋子…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.57,0:44:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的大屁股 离我远一点好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.57,0:44:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是恶心耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.87,0:44:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你屁股闻起来 还不是有一股驴屎味
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.36,0:44:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里其中的一种药 肯定有效
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.97,0:44:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀！我也刚好这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.37,0:44:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到我们真有 心有灵犀一点通耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.17,0:44:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,少在这里肉麻当有趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.38,0:44:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我们需要 马屁精的时候再找你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.27,0:44:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克 这点子很逊耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.27,0:44:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 闭上你的驴嘴 到门口去守着
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.57,0:44:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,靴猫 你有办法能爬到最上面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.67,0:44:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 大佬
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.77,0:44:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的另外一个外号 就叫蜘蛛猫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.37,0:44:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,最擅长的就是爬101大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.58,0:44:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克 你是不是疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.87,0:44:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子 看门去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.07,0:44:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看门去？好 让我看就去看…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.49,0:45:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要看那个邪恶的巫婆 把你关到养得肥肥胖胖的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.47,0:45:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后煮来吃
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.58,0:45:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候我就在旁边大笑 笑到肚子痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.58,0:45:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.57,0:45:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,癞蛤蟆泄药
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅喔 你还真聪明耶
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你干脆找一瓶能 增进夫妻之间幸福的药
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.77,0:45:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,知识糖浆？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.58,0:45:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,通便剂？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.77,0:45:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 有没有帅哥药？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.37,0:45:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 没有帅哥药
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.97,0:45:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！可是有… 幸福快乐神仙水？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.48,0:45:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 那是干什么用的？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.88,0:45:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写 「快速美丽」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.58,0:45:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？在某些文化里头 把驴子当做是最聪明的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.98,0:45:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是会说话的驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.68,0:45:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.08,0:45:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就拿那那个吧 有人来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.89,0:45:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是不死心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.88,0:45:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.87,0:46:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,接的好 驴子.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.17,0:46:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不简单啊 你这驴嘴终于有点用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.78,0:46:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.48,0:46:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你无视我的感情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.28,0:46:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 视我如粪土 教我肝肠寸断 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.48,0:46:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我开始动摇 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.98,0:46:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就得冒失去她的危险 结局反而更糟 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.28,0:46:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 曾经爱上一个人 刻苦铭心… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.09,0:46:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱上了某人 刻苦铭心… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.69,0:46:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一个不该爱的人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.48,0:46:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 曾经爱上一个人 曾经爱上… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.08,0:47:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一个人 曾经爱上… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.88,0:47:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一个不该爱的人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.88,0:47:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 曾经爱上… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.98,0:47:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 曾经爱上一个 不该爱的人刻苦铭心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.99,0:47:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不打算追究责任
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.58,0:47:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点把这里给我清干净
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.58,0:47:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 教母
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.79,0:47:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 不管是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.38,0:47:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点去拿点甜死人 的巧克力来给我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.39,0:47:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.29,0:47:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 我亲爱的！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.79,0:47:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来得真不是时候 妈妈正在忙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.39,0:47:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！这里发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.99,0:47:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要怪那只妖怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.79,0:47:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.79,0:47:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.98,0:47:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要让他跪地求饶！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.68,0:47:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打到他四肢无力！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.89,0:47:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他每天都后悔 抢走我的王国
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.79,0:47:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要激动 年轻人 你一定会当上国王的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.38,0:47:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要好好 想个办法就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.49,0:47:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 我已经清点完毕了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.58,0:47:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,神仙教母 只有神仙水不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.39,0:48:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.59,0:48:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下子我们的机会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.79,0:48:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸褔快乐神仙水… 上面写药效惊人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.48,0:48:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你的真爱
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.39,0:48:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要其中一个人喝下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.60,0:48:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从此就 会过着幸福快乐的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.39,0:48:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对两个人都有效？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.70,0:48:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这对费欧娜也应该有用
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.39,0:48:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…我总觉得怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.19,0:48:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的驴子第六感觉很不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.09,0:48:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快把这个神仙水丢掉 一起离开这个鬼地方
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.79,0:48:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,上头说它「快速美丽」 看看它有多快嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.79,0:48:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对这个东西会过敏 一定会出大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.68,0:48:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你挂了 你这么肥 我可没有办法抬你回去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.18,0:48:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.29,0:48:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大 你要考虑不伤身再求药效
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.49,0:48:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如让小弟先帮你喝一口
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.09,0:48:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够为你牺牲性命 是我天大的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.70,0:48:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.40,0:48:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么认为哦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.39,0:48:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真的要进行动物实验
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.09,0:48:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也应该我来才对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.59,0:49:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫做好朋友呢 把瓶子给我…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.50,0:49:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有什么感觉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.00,0:49:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有变吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.40,0:49:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来还是很驴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.39,0:49:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定这药对驴子没用
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.79,0:49:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧… 为了我们幸福费欧娜
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.10,0:49:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.09,0:49:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了以后 你就不能再回头啰
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.09,0:49:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.89,0:49:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以后就再也不能在沼泽打滚哦 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.28,0:49:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不能再树上抓痒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.50,0:49:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.49,0:49:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你当妖怪当得很爽耶
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.59,0:49:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.99,0:49:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我更爱费欧娜
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.80,0:49:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克 不要冲动
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.30,0:49:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…臭…臭滚滚
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.40,0:49:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝的该不会是 快速放屁药水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.71,0:50:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概过期了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.80,0:50:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我跟费欧娜 根本不该在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.10,0:50:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我就说有问题嘛 我好像哪里不对劲哦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.90,0:50:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想死！我不要死！我不要死啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.19,0:50:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣 观世音菩萨… 我全身发软！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.79,0:50:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快要融化了…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.60,0:50:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,下雨而已了 驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.90,0:51:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克 看开点 不要因为下雨困在森林里…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.20,0:51:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜她老爸又找一只 笨猫来杀你而难过嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.30,0:51:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天会更好的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.10,0:51:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.40,0:51:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 太阳依旧… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.19,0:51:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 会升起… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.60,0:51:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 放手一搏… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.61,0:51:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手一搏？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.21,0:51:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…我晕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.11,0:51:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.70,0:51:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.70,0:51:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大 我来逗他玩
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.50,0:51:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴…驴子…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.11,0:51:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来啦！怎么没来吃晚餐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.60,0:51:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事啊 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.81,0:51:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王 我一直在想你说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.40,0:51:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我做错了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.01,0:52:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！太好了！这才是我女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不该带史瑞克回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.60,0:52:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去外面找他
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.30,0:52:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再一起回到 属于我们的沼泽去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.71,0:52:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜！别这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.41,0:52:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这么急嘛 这么晚了你哪也去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.91,0:52:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.79,0:53:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我就跟你说他就在这里了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.42,0:53:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘…安静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.51,0:53:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.81,0:53:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 爱睡猪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.71,0:53:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安！我们好喜欢你猫哦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.00,0:53:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 头痛死了…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.61,0:53:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我帮你把水打好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.71,0:53:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔…谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.41,0:53:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅气的鼻头？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.11,0:53:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,又浓又黑的卷发？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.72,0:53:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,扎实圆润的屁股？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.51,0:53:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.32,0:53:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好帅啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.32,0:53:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对啊 - 我是吉儿 你叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.41,0:53:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.80,0:53:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.42,0:53:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！你是上流社会的人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.40,0:53:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好紧张哦 - 我帮你按摩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.40,0:53:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来就行了 谢谢！- 那我按哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.60,0:53:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到后面去排队
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.10,0:53:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有没有看到我的驴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.11,0:53:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫谁「驴子」？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.12,0:53:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子？！你变成…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.91,0:54:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一匹神驹！马的呼叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.61,0:54:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会踏步…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.31,0:54:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.31,0:54:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会小跑步耶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.91,0:54:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个药水真神奇 不知道是什么做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.61,0:54:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是哪个驴蛋说：「快把药水丢掉…」
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.12,0:54:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「注意 药的副作用有：发热 发痒 头昏 流泪…」
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.81,0:54:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不适合心脏病患者 或情绪不稳定的人喝」
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.81,0:54:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小跑步小跑步 我会小跑步 耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.71,0:54:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.71,0:54:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大 「要让药效长长久久…」
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.31,0:54:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「喝下这药的人 必须在午夜之前…」
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.91,0:54:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「…得到真爱的吻」
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.21,0:54:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜？干嘛都规定在午夜？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.22,0:54:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 选我 我是你的真爱 - 我才是你的真爱
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.81,0:54:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全身都是…真爱
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.41,0:54:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 美女们 我己经有真爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.11,0:54:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大 我敢担保
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.52,0:54:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主看到你 一定会满意得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.52,0:54:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵…好了 面对现实吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.42,0:55:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的确是长得比较帅了 可是骨子里还是土里土气的…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.21,0:55:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远是个暴躁下流的 臭熏熏的妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.62,0:55:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骨子也还是那头呱噪的驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.62,0:55:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对阿！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.43,0:55:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…亲爱的公主 新的史瑞克就要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.72,0:55:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…先换掉你的衣服 我想这个才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.13,0:55:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了吗？- 好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.01,0:55:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,马夫 停车！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.01,0:55:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊！救救我！我全身上下都动不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.82,0:55:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞎了！我看不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.61,0:55:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我这辈子 我还能不能拉小提琴？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.62,0:55:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！可怜的小东西 有什么我可以为你做的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.02,0:55:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 我想有一件事情你可以帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.13,0:55:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱下你的假发 还有你全身上下的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.12,0:55:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不错嘛 - 真的很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.92,0:56:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸… 一切都还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.02,0:56:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.63,0:56:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天我会报答你的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.83,0:56:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非再也见不到你 或是我忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.92,0:56:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 瞧这些新鲜事 都-都-都变了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.72,0:56:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有钱有什么了不起 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.92,0:56:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 要…改变 换张脸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.03,0:56:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不可思议的改变 要…改变 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.13,0:56:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只想要与众不同 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.23,0:56:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 时间也许可以改变我 但我却留不住它 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.53,0:57:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.72,0:57:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉费欧娜公主
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.82,0:57:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的丈夫 史瑞克爵士来看她了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.72,0:57:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我仍然懵懵懂懂 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.02,0:57:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 岁月流逝 我却一事无成 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.23,0:57:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每次我以为可以成功 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.42,0:57:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 却总是事与愿违 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.13,0:57:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 啾…全变了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.83,0:57:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 瞧这些新鲜事 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.13,0:57:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 费欧娜？- 史瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.52,0:57:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 时间也许可以改变我 但我却留不住它 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.14,0:57:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.63,0:57:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.73,0:57:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.62,0:57:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.53,0:57:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.53,0:57:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 那个神仙水真的很有用耶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.82,0:57:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么神仙水啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.13,0:57:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说来话长 史瑞克跟我都喝了神仙水
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.43,0:58:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都变成超级大帅哥了！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.63,0:58:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.42,0:58:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 为了你 我愿意当…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.23,0:58:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想的美！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.53,0:58:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.03,0:58:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进去里面找你啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.23,0:58:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.93,0:58:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.03,0:58:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.43,0:58:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要跳舞啊 帅哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.24,0:58:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛急着走嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.94,0:58:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想看见你太太吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.44,0:58:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.84,0:58:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.43,0:58:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.94,0:58:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的声音怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.53,0:58:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,神仙水帮我彻底改变了 费欧娜…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.23,0:58:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是爱你的心没变
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.63,0:58:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.93,0:58:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.33,0:58:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也觉得我帅啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.64,0:58:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.43,0:58:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直希望得到您的认同
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.93,0:59:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.64,0:59:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,母后 是我 史瑞克啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.44,0:59:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道上次我们见面 你把我当成妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.23,0:59:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还这么想吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.03,0:59:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜！费欧娜！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.44,0:59:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.55,0:59:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 费欧娜！- 费欧娜…费欧娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.34,0:59:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫啊 可惜他们听不到 帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.33,0:59:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉你把她 害得还不够惨吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.33,0:59:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望她能开开心心的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.65,0:59:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在就很开心啊… 噢…算了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.44,0:59:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她梦中的王子终于出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.23,0:59:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我变成这样… 全是为了她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.83,0:59:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要活在童话故事里了 史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.74,0:59:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是公主 而你是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.34,1:00:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你现在这样 也改变不了这个事实
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.54,1:00:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是… 我爱她！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.95,1:00:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的爱她 就让她走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.74,1:00:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克？老大？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.04,1:00:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.54,1:00:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去那里？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.14,1:00:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事该不会是 你干的好事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.63,1:00:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是 哈洛？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.04,1:00:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 人们并不如想像中善良 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.64,1:00:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这并不难理解 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.35,1:00:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的酒来了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.65,1:00:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这明明就不让我留下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.75,1:00:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…干吗这么沮丧？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.44,1:01:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的这一切真是太笨了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.74,1:01:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一开始就不应该 把她从高塔里救出来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.95,1:01:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,千金难买早知道
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.74,1:01:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信你就这样 放弃你最重要的一切
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.55,1:01:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没得选择啊… 她喜欢那个小帅哥
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.75,1:01:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么白马王子…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.94,1:01:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮忙吧 他哪里有多帅啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.34,1:01:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在胡说些什么？他帅呆了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.55,1:01:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脸简直就是上帝的杰作
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.53,1:01:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他好像很怕他…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.03,1:01:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他不够帅 我也不见得比较开心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.65,1:01:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的结局 应该就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.35,1:01:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王王后很喜欢 费欧娜梦中的王子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.15,1:01:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都很开心
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.45,1:01:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你不开心 我真是搞不懂你耶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.45,1:01:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱费欧娜啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.45,1:01:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！所以我才应该放弃她
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.04,1:01:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.66,1:02:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在里面吗？- 她在…后面
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.45,1:02:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,又见面啦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.25,1:02:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,神仙教母… 帅哥…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.24,1:02:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你把我们叫来 是有重要的事 哈洛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.95,1:02:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得费欧娜好像 还没有准备好…嫁给帅哥
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.05,1:02:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别赖我哦 我可没错啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.15,1:02:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…当然 你当然没错
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.66,1:02:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.66,1:02:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我这个超帅哥 去演一个丑妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.65,1:02:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么去演嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.95,1:02:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 或许…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.95,1:02:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不… 这不是错不错的问题
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.84,1:02:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该取消这个计划好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.45,1:02:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.24,1:02:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说… 爱不能勉强的对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.64,1:02:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我可不同意 我就常干这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.26,1:02:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让费欧娜喝下这个
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.25,1:02:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就会情不自禁 爱上第一个吻她的人…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.95,1:02:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然就是我儿子啰
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.15,1:02:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯… 不行！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.65,1:02:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.05,1:02:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我不要 我不会做
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.44,1:03:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然会
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.45,1:03:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该还记得… 是我让你幸福快乐的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.85,1:03:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你 我也可以轻易收回这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.55,1:03:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望我这么做吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.35,1:03:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.55,1:03:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…不希望
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.94,1:03:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才乖 好啦 我们该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.05,1:03:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得带我儿子去做头发呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.36,1:03:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面老是翘起来 后面又乱七八糟
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.36,1:03:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是麻烦…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.85,1:03:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要找个人帮他整理一下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.85,1:03:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…谢谢你 妈咪
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.35,1:03:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.55,1:03:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…看啊！马也会说话
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.15,1:03:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,妖怪！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.26,1:03:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他们！小偷！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.86,1:03:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,强盗！抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.76,1:03:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的肌肉男 请跟随家属的屁股…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.85,1:03:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来参加今晚 远得要命王国的舞会
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.86,1:03:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个王国车水马龙
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.56,1:03:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,着装精美的人们 前来参加这场美丽的盛会
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.65,1:03:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,全国知名同胞一起前来向 费欧娜公主跟史瑞克王子致敬
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.16,1:03:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！天那！… 大家打扮得真是争奇斗艳
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.75,1:04:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看！是汉斯和葛丽娜（糖果屋） 他们还是边走一边撒饼干碎呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.25,1:04:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧接著在他们后面的是… 姆指姑娘跟姆指汤姆！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.46,1:04:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好可爱呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.25,1:04:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的是… 睡美人…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.26,1:04:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她永远都是这么累…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.06,1:04:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁啊？谁来了？是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.86,1:04:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们最爱最受欢迎 万民拥戴的…神仙教母…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.74,1:04:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好！远的要命王国子民们！！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.26,1:04:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不到欢呼…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.86,1:04:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝福大家都幸福美满 还有…你们都知道的了…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.66,1:04:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,广告之后… 马上回到皇家结婚舞会现场
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.65,1:04:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要转台哦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.86,1:04:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最讨压这些特别节目了 无聊得快死掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.75,1:04:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看前面的 换个台吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.26,1:04:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没水准 我才不要乱转台呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.66,1:04:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看史瑞克跟费欧娜
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.65,1:04:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些人很讨压耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.66,1:04:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠 我要吃鸡翅膀！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.95,1:04:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 在你的左边…左边啦！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.36,1:05:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎收看… 社会追寻…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.95,1:05:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算有好节目了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.66,1:05:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一匹白色野马往森林逃窜
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.66,1:05:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要支援
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.96,1:05:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察大队出动教训这些 以为治安是白设的流氓
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.66,1:05:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要他们不敢为非作歹
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.66,1:05:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么抓我？警察打人啊！警察打人啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.77,1:05:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我跟费欧娜公主讲话！- 我警告你…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.56,1:05:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,歹徒会不会逍遥法外呢？还是真相会站在正义的一方？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.56,1:05:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个资本主义走狗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.67,1:05:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到了…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.67,1:05:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.46,1:05:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 我要见费欧娜公主
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.16,1:05:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是驴子！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.16,1:05:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她 我是她丈夫…史瑞克！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.66,1:05:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,社会追寻
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.06,1:05:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快倒带！！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.46,1:05:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她 我是她丈夫…史瑞克！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.07,1:06:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖女儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.26,1:06:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.87,1:06:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在参加舞会之前 要不要先喝杯热茶啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.86,1:06:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要参加
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.47,1:06:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是整个国的人 都来庆祝你的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.76,1:06:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在问题是… 那个人根本不是我丈夫
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.96,1:06:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.36,1:06:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是有点不一样了 人都会他所爱的人改变
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.47,1:06:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我为了你母亲 作了多大的改变
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.47,1:06:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变？他现在这个样子简直是疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.76,1:06:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖女儿你就下去参加舞会 再给他个机会
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.16,1:06:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定你会爱上 这个全新的史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.47,1:07:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我爱上的是 那个旧的史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.58,1:07:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意放弃一切让他变回来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.07,1:07:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这杯是我的 没咖啡因…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.16,1:07:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕晚上睡不著…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.76,1:07:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.16,1:07:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.66,1:07:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把我锁住在这里！放我走！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.47,1:07:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本没有 审驴子的权利
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.67,1:07:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该告诉我 「你有权保持沉默」
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.67,1:07:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是却没有人 告诉我这些权力…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.47,1:07:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子！你是有权保持沉默！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.67,1:07:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你真的很嘈啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.17,1:07:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须撑着点 不然我也会跟他一样抓狂
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.07,1:07:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.36,1:07:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.67,1:07:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.57,1:07:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,姜饼人！小木偶！快救我们出去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.47,1:07:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要爆炸啦！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.18,1:08:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.96,1:08:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！撒个谎！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.07,1:08:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 要我说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.68,1:08:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便了 快！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.97,1:08:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要夸张点的 说你穿女生的内衣好了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.67,1:08:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我穿了女生的内衣
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.07,1:08:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…你穿了？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.08,1:08:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才没有穿呢！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.78,1:08:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的鼻子告诉我你有穿哦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.88,1:08:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有穿！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.88,1:08:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一款呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.79,1:08:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是雷斯丁的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.97,1:08:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不穿女生的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.68,1:08:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才不是 - 是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.68,1:08:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才不是 - 是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.38,1:08:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 到达了 抓紧哦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.58,1:08:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…小心点…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.67,1:09:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,干吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.18,1:09:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋猫！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.98,1:09:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你让他放了我…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.47,1:09:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 老大.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.47,1:09:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再闹了 我们得阻止他们亲嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.08,1:09:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要放弃费欧娜吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.17,1:09:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 可是我不能让他们这样对待她
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.68,1:09:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了！就是要这样的气魄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.68,1:09:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脑袋终于开窍了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.89,1:09:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不可能的 城堡都是守卫
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.67,1:09:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,四周还有护城河 我们进不去的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.07,1:09:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子我们现在就是 少了一座可以过河的桥
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.89,1:09:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.69,1:09:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得松饼人住哪吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.67,1:09:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得 他就住在松饼巷
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.48,1:09:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.58,1:09:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要面粉 很多很多面粉…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.87,1:09:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姜姜！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.48,1:09:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点开火炉 松饼人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.68,1:09:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一笔大生意要交给你！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.28,1:10:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是活的耶…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.29,1:10:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲… 快冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.07,1:10:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 前进！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.29,1:10:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那样 往城堡走！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.69,1:10:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…不对不对 你这个笨饼干！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.69,1:10:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.58,1:10:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里！这里！跟着我走！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.48,1:10:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了对了 跟着我的小马走
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.18,1:10:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小马要带你到城堡去玩
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.48,1:10:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱的小马！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.77,1:10:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士！我为你介绍费欧娜公主…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.09,1:10:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她的丈夫… 史瑞克王子！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.19,1:11:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克 你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.39,1:11:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在展现我的魅力
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.38,1:11:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的嘴巴擦了唇膏吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.88,1:11:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,樱桃口味的 要不要尝尝啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.38,1:11:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是怎么了？！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.09,1:11:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我没怎么样…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.89,1:11:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,C小调 我要C小调
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.69,1:11:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.68,1:11:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把这首歌献给
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.58,1:11:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜公主…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.68,1:11:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有史瑞克王子
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.09,1:11:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜 亲爱的公主
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.69,1:11:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意赏脸跳支舞吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.29,1:11:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 曾走过的苦难中…啊… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.67,1:11:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去哪里追寻… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.88,1:11:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去那曾经追寻过的… 所有的幻想… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.69,1:11:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是否一样的希望… 只存在梦境… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.49,1:11:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候会跳舞啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.28,1:12:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的费欧娜 我只能告诉你…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.18,1:12:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…生命充满了意外惊喜
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.19,1:12:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一整夜 我都辗转难眠 只知道我爱你… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.29,1:12:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.59,1:12:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我需要英雄 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.69,1:12:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大饼 我们准备要冲进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.69,1:12:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护队准备！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.28,1:12:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准！发射！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.88,1:12:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己保重啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.00,1:12:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大饼 你没事吧？撑着点…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.99,1:12:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.40,1:12:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈-哈！帅啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.10,1:13:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每到午夜时分 在我狂野的梦里… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.30,1:13:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 大饼！走…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.19,1:13:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,游击队准备！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.09,1:13:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先吧 大饼！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.99,1:13:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力！用力…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.29,1:13:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.90,1:13:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再热一点！把他融掉！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.89,1:13:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 整夜同行到天堂里拥抱… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.90,1:13:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让快乐来临 劈开大海… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.10,1:13:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我真的感觉到 有人在看着我… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.00,1:13:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.40,1:13:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要…！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.30,1:14:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.50,1:14:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！大饼…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.70,1:14:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.69,1:14:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下我！让我回去…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.60,1:14:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.40,1:14:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋猫！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.89,1:15:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 走！公主需要你 走…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.40,1:15:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 让我抛热颅洒热血…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.90,1:15:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…看招！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.70,1:15:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他浑身是胆… 从不畏惧苦难 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.20,1:15:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他为了胜利决战… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.31,1:15:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我需要英雄… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.70,1:15:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.10,1:15:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你！快放开我老婆！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.50,1:15:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.51,1:15:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能回你的沼泽去 让我们大家…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.71,1:15:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…过过好日子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.71,1:15:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放射… 炮弹预备！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.90,1:15:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪肉飞弹…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.50,1:15:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小木偶！快抢下魔杖
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.71,1:15:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么越来越晕啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.70,1:15:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真的小男孩！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.51,1:16:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.21,1:16:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,驴子！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.89,1:16:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真的小男孩！噢…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.51,1:16:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的仙妇棒…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.21,1:16:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒克星 靴猫…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.11,1:16:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有驴子！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.51,1:16:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经喝了药水了！快点亲她！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.71,1:16:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要…！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.31,1:17:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.21,1:17:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.42,1:17:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛！你不是已经给她吃过药了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.51,1:17:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大概是我拿错杯子了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.62,1:17:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.62,1:17:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.51,1:17:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 公主遇上妖怪 不会有好下场的！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.52,1:17:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.52,1:17:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈咯…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.72,1:17:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这… - 对…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.01,1:17:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他挂了…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.01,1:17:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.21,1:17:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.21,1:18:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多不希望你看到我的真面目
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.72,1:18:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪！他比你还丑耶！- 驴子！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.22,1:18:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 他说的没错
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.42,1:18:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对不起你们俩个 我一直希望费欧娜能够幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.41,1:18:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在看得出来… 她真的很幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.82,1:18:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,史瑞克 费欧娜…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.01,1:18:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们愿意接受 一只老青蛙的道歉…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.41,1:18:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有祝福吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.31,1:18:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈洛…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.41,1:18:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 莉雅 我希望我能成为值得你爱的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.82,1:18:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来就是全世界 最值得我爱的男人…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.82,1:18:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都不会变
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.71,1:18:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大！药效时间快到了…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.51,1:18:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜了…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.52,1:18:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,费欧娜 你希望我们变成这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.33,1:18:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一辈子都这样？- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.32,1:19:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你现在吻我 我们一辈子都变成这样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.62,1:19:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为了我… 才改变的？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.11,1:19:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.72,1:19:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要每个公主都希望的结局 从此幸福快乐地…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.42,1:19:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…跟妖怪在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.92,1:19:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要坚强 我不可以哭！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.03,1:19:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能害我哭…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.62,1:20:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要 不要…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.63,1:20:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我心目中 永远是一匹骏马！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.02,1:20:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我们刚刚到哪了？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.63,1:20:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.72,1:20:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是说好了 …要开舞会吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.23,1:20:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一、二、三…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.23,1:20:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来噢！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.92,1:21:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要唱歌了哦…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.53,1:21:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她痴于迷信 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.33,1:21:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 黑猫跟巫毒降蛊 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.02,1:21:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 换你唱 猫咪！！- ∮ 我有种预感 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.73,1:21:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她将会毁了我 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.82,1:21:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赖哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.93,1:21:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她喜欢有新鲜感 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.73,1:21:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 烛光里的新舞姿 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.23,1:21:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不时变换新嗜好 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.03,1:21:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每天每夜 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.53,1:21:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她令你衣衫尽褪… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.84,1:21:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在雨中漫舞 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.13,1:21:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她令你过着她那样的疯狂生活 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.24,1:21:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但她会带走你的痛苦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.84,1:21:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 像颗子弹射入你脑中 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.33,1:21:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 上下内外颠覆 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.93,1:21:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她过著疯狂的日子 ∮
